<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DAN" style="id">- Tsishingini (tsw)</book>
  <para style="h">Daniya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Dan</para>
  <para style="toc2">Daniya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Daniya</para>
  <para style="mt2">Daniya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Daniya</para>
  <para style="is">Ucuɗuwu wa aatagada a nda</para>
  <para style="ip">A ɗana ta̱ aatagada a Daniya a mantsa ma na aza a Yahuda o sowuso a̱tsuma̱lima̱ lon e ekere wutsugbu nu u suɗatosu u mogono ma na ma̱ ri za va Yahuda shi. Ili na̱ a̱bunda̱ a na a cayi alabari e le pa nda, a fara ta̱ ɗa e iɗa ya Babila. Waru e reve ta̱ na ama a Babila a na a̱ ri e iɗa ya Kaldiya.</para>
  <para style="ip">Zavi iɗana'a u yuwan ta̱ ulinga na alabari oɓolo nu ucuɗuwu wa alavu alavu adama a ca ama adanshi a mantsa ma̱ a̱ yi. U yuwan ta̱ ne adama a zuwa a na A̱sula̱ a̱ ta̱ mula̱ mogono ma wuya reve u ka̱mba̱to tsugono ekere a ama A̱sula̱.</para>
  <para style="ip">Aatagada'a u tu utanu na a ɗa a̱ re.</para>
  <para style="ip">1 Alabari adama a Daniya oɓolo na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ yi e iɗa i tsugbashi za̱la̱ tsugono tsa Babila na̱ Pashiya. Daniya oɓolo na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ yi gba a̱tsuma̱ o ure wu ucawu wo okolo e le uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sula̱ na̱ tsutoni tsa̱ le uba̱ta̱ wa̱ yi ɗaɗa a̱ tsura̱i ulyuwu wa aci e ekere a n'yuwatan n le.</para>
  <para style="ip">2 Ugeru wa alavu alavu a na Daniya enei, aza a na a cayi urevu u le a̱tsuma̱ e iroci na o rocosu u'ya̱sun tsugono na̱ a̱risa̱ e le.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ikaka ya aatagada'a u ta̱ rocosu a na A̱sula̱ a̱ ri nu ucira e ekere tsugono oɓolo na̱ vaɗilima̱, o kototosu tsugono tsa a na a yuwusan tsushu'un na̱ yi, waru a̱ shuwisa̱ tsugono ta̱ a̱ yi, zana tarai nɗa suru.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ili i na i ri pe a̱tsuma̱ a aatagada a nda</para>
  <para style="io1">Daniya na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ yi 1:1-6:28</para>
  <para style="io1">Alavu alavu a na o rocoyi Daniya 7:1-12:13</para>
  <para style="io1">Inama a̱ na̱shi 7:1-38</para>
  <para style="io1">Kyon na̱ ma̱ga̱ji 8:1-9:27</para>
  <para style="io1">Za vi ikaka diga zuva 10:1-11:45</para>
  <para style="io1">Mantsa mo ukosu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DAN 1" />
  <para style="s">A tarai Daniya a̱ tyo Babila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 1:1" />A̱tsuma̱ a aa'wan a ta'atsu o tsugono tsa Jehoyakim mogono ma Yahuda, Nebukanaza mogono ma Babila ma̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ Urishelima a̱vu u ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ yi nu uvon. <verse eid="DAN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 1:2" />Reve A̱sulazuva a ca Jehoyakim mogono ma Yahuda e ekere a̱ yi oɓolo ni itana ya̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sula̱. Reve u pura̱ le a̱ tyo a̱ a̱a̱'isa̱ a̱ ma̱sula̱ ma̱ yi e iɗa ya Shina<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Shina a̱yi ɗa aala o ro a Babila.</char></note>, reve u zuwa le o uzuwata wa̱ a̱a̱'isa̱ a̱ ma̱sula̱ ma̱ yi.<verse eid="DAN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 1:3" />Reve mogono'o ma zuwa Ashpenaza, zagbain va azagbain a̱ yi u ta̱wa̱a̱ na aza a Isra'ila o ro diga o umatsun u tsugono na̱ wa azagbain, <verse eid="DAN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 1:4" />olobo a na a̱ ri usa̱du shi, ulobonu wa̱ a̱ka̱nla̱ aza a na a̱ ri nu urevu nu uguru wu ulinga suru aza a na o ritoi lon. Olobo'o aza a na a̱ ri na̱ ma̱puna̱ ma na ee reve ili go'o, waru a ntsayi a yuwan a̱ga̱nda̱ o ukobu u mogono. O roco le elentsu ni iɗana ya aza a Babila. <verse eid="DAN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 1:5" />Mogono ma zuwaa le ta̱ akunda e ilyalya i le na̱ masayan mo urana suru a̱tsuma̱ e ilyalya ya̱ yi. O to rito le a'wan a ta'atsu, reve no o koto e reme ulinga u mogono.<verse eid="DAN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 1:6" />A̱tsuma̱ e le aza a Yahuda a̱ shi ta̱ pe: Daniya na̱ Hananiya na̱ Mishel na̱ Azariya. <verse eid="DAN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 1:7" />Reve zagbain va azagbai'in u ca le ala a sa'avu: Daniya a̱yi ɗa a cayi Belteshaza, Hananiya waru a̱yi ɗa a cayi Shadra, Meshe a̱yi ɗa a cayi Mesha reve waru a ca Azariya Abedenego.<verse eid="DAN 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 1:8" />A̱vu gba Daniya tara o okolo a̱ yi wa̱a̱ lungusa̱ aciya̱yi ni ilyalya na̱ masayan mo tsugono shi. Ɗaɗa u patiyi zagbain va azagbain u lyawa yi adama u lungusa̱ aciya̱yi wan. <verse eid="DAN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 1:9" />Reve gba A̱sula̱ a zuwa Daniya tsura̱ isa'ani ni icigi e ekere a zagbai'in. <verse eid="DAN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 1:10" />Agba a̱vu zagbai'in u damma Daniya, &lt;&lt;N ta uwwusa wovon wu zagbain va̱ mogono, za na zuwai ilyalya ni ili yo oso ya̱ wu. Na̱ we ene vu lobono tsa akapi o olobo acari a̱ wu shi, vu ta zuwa aaci a̱ va̱ e meleshe e ekere o mogono.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 1:11" />Reve Daniya damma za vi ipiri na zagbain na zuwayi Daniya na̱ Hananiya na̱ Mishel na̱ Azariya, <verse eid="DAN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 1:12" />&lt;&lt;Yuwan ankuri vu lyungwa̱ agbashi a̱ wu hali rana kupa: Vu casu tsu a̱vu'un o usa'an wa̱ a̱a̱rumbu na̱ mini mo oso. <verse eid="DAN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 1:13" />Reve vu kurato tsu no olobo a na aa lyuwusa ilyalya i mogono, reve vu yuwan na agbashi a̱ wu ni ili i na ve enei.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="DAN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 1:14" />A̱vu u usu ili i na a dammai, reve u lyungwa̱ le rana kupa.<verse eid="DAN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 1:15" />O ukosu wu rana kupa'a, reve urewesu u le u la'a ulobonu. Reve waru a la'a olobo a na a lyuwai ilyalya i tsugono mgbain. <verse eid="DAN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 1:16" />Ɗaɗa za vi ipiri'i u tawai ilyalya na̱ masayan me le ma na a̱ shi a̱ ri n sowuso, a̱vu u reme a casu le a̱vu'un o usa'an wa̱ a̱a̱rumbu.<verse eid="DAN 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 1:17" />Reve gba A̱sula̱ a ca olobo a̱ na̱shi a nda urevu nu uguru wa atagada suru. Daniya tsura̱ ta̱ urevu wa alavu alavu na̱ wa alavu suru.<verse eid="DAN 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 1:18" />O ukosu u mantsa ma na mogono ma zuwai na a̱a̱ ta̱wa̱ ne ele, reve zagbai'in u ta̱wa̱ ne ele a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma Nebukanaza. <verse eid="DAN 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 1:19" />Reve mogono ma yuwan adanshi ne ele. A̱vu we ene ko za ri tsa Daniya na̱ Hananiya na̱ Mishel na̱ Azariya shi. Adama o ndolo a̱vu e reme a yuwusaan mogono a̱ga̱nda̱. <verse eid="DAN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 1:20" />Reve a̱tsuma̱ e ili i na i burai urevu nu uguru wi ili i na mogono me ece nle suru, reve we ene a la'a ta̱ a̱za̱ a̱ yindi no ozo o tsuboci a na a̱ ri uba̱ta̱ u tsugono tsa̱ yi suru toto kupa.<verse eid="DAN 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 1:21" />Reve Daniya da̱nu pe hali she a aa'wan o ufaru o mogono Sairu.<verse eid="DAN 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DAN 2" />
  <para style="s">Alavu a Nebukanaza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 2:1" />A̱tsuma̱ a aa'wan e ire o tsugono tsa Nebukanaza, Nebukanaza yuwan ta̱ alavu; reve u ɓa̱la̱ yi, a̱vu u kuɗa̱ a lantsa. <verse eid="DAN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 2:2" />Ɗaɗa mogono ma zuwa e ɗeyi a̱za̱ a̱ yindi no ozo o tsuboci na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ a̱guma̱ na aza a avasa a̱ a̱ma̱li a̱ ta̱wa̱ a ca yi ucuɗuwu wa alavu a̱ yi. Ana a̱ ta̱wa̱ e isawain a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n mo mogono, <verse eid="DAN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 2:3" />a̱vu u damma le, &lt;&lt;N yuwan ta̱ alavu a na aa damatosun mu waru n ciga ta̱ n reve ucuɗuwu wa̱ a̱yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 2:4" />Reve aza a avasa a̱ a̱ma̱li'i a̱ usu mogono na̱ Tsu'arama a damma, &lt;&lt;Mogono lyawa wuma wa̱ wu u jima! Damma agbashi a̱ wu alavu'u tsu ta cuɗuwa wu a̱yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 2:5" />Reve mogono ma̱ usu aza a avasa a̱ a̱ma̱li'i &lt;&lt;Apa nda ili i na mi isawatoin o okolo a̱ va̱, nni i kuɗa̱ e revetyo mu alavu a̱ va̱ nu ucuɗuwu wa̱ yi, n ta zuwa o koɗo ɗu okoɗi okoɗi, a̱vu a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ 'wa ɗu okongo. <verse eid="DAN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 2:6" />Amma ni i damma mu alavu'u nu ucuɗuwu wa̱ yi, i ta̱ ushi uneꞌe na atsupu ya̱'a̱ va̱ na̱ tsugbain tsa gbain. Adama o ndolo damma numu alavu'u nu ucuɗuwu wa̱ yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 2:7" />Reve a̱ usuwisa̱, &lt;&lt;Lyawa mogono ma damma agbashi a̱ yi alavu'u, a̱tsu gba tsu ta damma yi ucuɗuwu wa̱ yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 2:8" />Reve mogono ma̱ usu u damma, &lt;&lt;N reve ta̱ ili i ro yi lo shi i ciga ta̱ i lungusa̱ mantsa, adama a na ye ene ta̱ adanshi a̱ va̱ a̱ ta̱ nu ucira: <verse eid="DAN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 2:9" />Nni i damma mu alavu'u shi, ugana u ta̱ u ɗa u ri nɗu lo. I ɓolo ta̱ aci adama i damma mu epen na adanshi e pere, hali she mantsa ma na addama a na tsu ri pe a vadala. Adama o ndolo damma numu alavu'u, reve n reve a na yaa gura cuɗuwa mu a̱yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 2:10" />Reve aza a avasa a̱ a̱ma̱li'i a̱ usu mogono'o a damma, &lt;&lt;Ko vuma pa o uvaɗi na waa gura usu ili i na mogono ma cigai shi! Babu mogono ma gbain ko mo ucira ma na me ecei ɗe boci ko za va̱ a̱guma̱ ko za va avasa a̱ a̱ma̱li cu'un vi ili i nda. <verse eid="DAN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 2:11" />Ili i na mogono me ecei u tu nu usa̱n lon. Ko vuma aa gura cuɗuwa mogono a̱yi shi she musula̱ goon, agba a̱ ri nden oɓolo na̱ vaɗilima̱ shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 2:12" />Adanshi a nda a zuwa ta̱ mogono ma yuwan upan lon, ɗaɗa u zuwai o kototo a̱za̱ o urevu a Babila suru. <verse eid="DAN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 2:13" />Ɗaɗa o uta̱yi udammu u na oo una le suru nle, reve a zami Daniya na̱ n'utsa̱ ma̱ yi adama o una le.<verse eid="DAN 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 2:14" />Reve Daniya yuwan adanshi na̱ Ariyo zagbain va̱ a̱za̱ e ipiri i mogono za na uta̱i adama wu una a̱za̱ o urevu wa Babila a̱tsuma̱ o ugbozu nu urevu. <verse eid="DAN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 2:15" />Reve we ece yi, &lt;&lt;Nye i zuwai mogono ma zuwai udammu wu usuɗuwu tsunda?&gt;&gt; A̱vu Ariyo cuɗuwa Daniya addama'a. <verse eid="DAN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 2:16" />Ɗaɗa Daniya 'ya̱wa̱i uba̱ta̱ u mogono, a̱vu u pati a̱ da̱shi yi mantsa adama u cuɗuwa mogono alavu'u.<verse eid="DAN 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 2:17" />Reve Daniya ka̱mba̱ o u'wa a̱vu u damma n'utsa̱ ma̱ yi Hananiya na̱ Mishel na̱ Azariya ili i na i yuwain. <verse eid="DAN 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 2:18" />A̱vu u damma le a pati isa'ani diga uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sula̱ a zuva adama e ili yu usokowu i nda, adama a̱yi na̱ n'utsa̱ ma̱ yi o kototo le oɓolo na akapi a̱ a̱za̱ o urevu a Babila wan. <verse eid="DAN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 2:19" />Reve a cuɗuwa Daniya ili yu usokowu'u na ayin a̱tsuma̱ a alavu alavu. Reve Daniya ciɓala A̱sula̱ a zuva, <verse eid="DAN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 2:20" />u damma, &lt;&lt;Aba'un a̱ tyo a ala a̱ A̱sula̱ babu ukotu, za na urevu nu ucira za va̱ yi ɗa. <verse eid="DAN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 2:21" />U tsu vadala ta̱ mantsa na̱ mmalu ma aa'wan; u tsu cipa̱to ta̱ ngono a̱vu waru u kumbato ngono. A̱yi ɗa u tsu ca za vu urevu urevu za vu uguru waru uguru. <verse eid="DAN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 2:22" />A̱yi ɗa u tsu pa̱lu'wa̱ ili yu usokowu i na i ri a̱ru'un; u reve ta̱ ili i na i ri a̱tsuma̱ e irumbu, ekan gba a̱ ta̱ uka̱nda̱ruwu na̱ a̱yi. <verse eid="DAN 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 2:23" />N godyoo wu ta̱ waru n cuwa wu ta̱ A̱sula̱ a mbara n va̱: Vu ca mu ta̱ urevu nu ucira, vu roco mu ta̱ ili i na tsu pati nuwu, vu roco tsu ta̱ ili i na yaa damatosun mogono.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daniya cuɗuwa ta̱ alavu'u</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 2:24" />Ɗaɗa Daniya 'ya̱wa̱i uba̱ta̱ wa Ariyo, za na mogono ma zuwai u kototo a̱za̱ o urevu a Babila, a̱vu u damma yi, &lt;&lt;She vu kototo a̱za̱ o urevu a Babila wan. Tara mu a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ u mogono, n ta cuɗuwa yi alavu a̱ yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 2:25" />Reve Ariyo jika̱ u tara Daniya a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ u mogono, reve u damma yi, &lt;&lt;N tsura̱ ta̱ vuma a̱tsuma̱ a aza a na a̱ pura̱i diga Yahuda za na aa cuɗuwa mogono urevu wa alavu a̱ yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 2:26" />Reve mogono ma damma Daniya, (za na waru a̱ tsu ɗe Belteshaza), &lt;&lt;Vu ta gura damma mu ili i na me enei a̱tsuma̱ a alavu a̱ va̱ nu ucuɗuwu wa̱ yi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 2:27" />A̱vu Daniya usu, &lt;&lt;Ko za vu urevu ko za yindi ko boci ko za va avasa a̱ a̱ma̱li lo na aa gura cuɗuwa mogono ili yu usokowu i na we ecei shi, <verse eid="DAN 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 2:28" />amma A̱sula̱ a̱ ta̱ ɗe zuva za na tsu pa̱lu'wa̱ ili yu usokowu, u roco ta̱ Nebukanaza mogono ili i na yaa fara elime. Alavu na alavu alavu a na ve enei a̱vu nven a̱ a̱ga̱da̱ ele ɗa nda.<verse eid="DAN 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 2:29" />&lt;&lt;Mogono a̱vu nven a̱ a̱ga̱da̱ a̱ wu, a̱vu okolo a̱ wu e reme majiyan me ili i na ya̱a̱ ta̱wa̱, a̱vu za na tsu pa̱lu'wa̱ ili yu usokowu u roco wu ili i na yaa fara. <verse eid="DAN 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 2:30" />Agba a̱mu, a̱ pa̱lu'wa̱a̱ mu ta̱ ili yu usokowu i nda, agba o una̱ u na n ri nu urevu u na u la'ai akapi a ama a na a̱ ri wuma ɗa shi, amma adama a̱vu mogono vu reve ucuɗuwu wa̱ yi waru adama vu reve majiyan ma na ma̱ ri o okolo a̱ wu.<verse eid="DAN 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 2:31" />&lt;&lt;Mogono vu ka̱lyuwa̱ ta̱ reve ve ene uruma u gbain u vuma wu ucira u wovon e ikanasa mishin elime a̱ wu. <verse eid="DAN 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 2:32" />Aaci o uruma u nda a yuwan yi ta̱ na̱ zinariya can, na̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ yi ne ekere a̱ yi a yuwan le ta̱ na̱ azurufa na̱ a̱tsuma̱ na agutsu a̱ yi a̱ rumushili, <verse eid="DAN 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 2:33" />na ana a̱ rumu adasutsu a̱ yi akapi rumu akapi olo'o. <verse eid="DAN 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 2:34" />A̱vu a̱ a̱ka̱nla̱, a̱vu aatali a ɓatsa, agba ukere u vuma u ɗa u ɓatsa niyi shi. A̱vu u jara uruma'a a adasutsu a̱ rumu no olo'o'o a̱vu wu mura le. <verse eid="DAN 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 2:35" />Reve rumu'u no olo'o na̱ rumushili na̱ azurufa na̱ zinariya'a o ɓoso mirimiri suru, a̱vu o o'wo tso owopo uba̱ta̱ wu faba vi ishina mantsa mo usuɗuwu. Reve upepu u pura̱ le suru suru ko ili u lyawa shi. Aatali a na gba a jarai uruma'a a̱vu wo o'wo masasan ma gbain, a̱vu u shiton uvaɗi suru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 2:36" />&lt;&lt;A̱yi nda'a a̱yi ɗaɗa alavu'u, gogo tsu ta cuɗuwa mogono a̱yi. <verse eid="DAN 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 2:37" />A̱vu mogono, a̱vu ɗa mogono mo ngono, za na A̱sula̱ a zuva a cayi tsugono nu ukadu na̱ tsugbain nu ucira; <verse eid="DAN 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DAN 2:38" />e ekere a̱ wu a ɗa u zuwai vaɗilima̱ ni inama yu una na̱ nnunu. Uba̱ta̱ u na a̱ ri suru, u ca wu ta̱ tsugbain a aci e le suru. A̱vu ɗa aaci a zinariya o ndolo'o. <verse eid="DAN 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DAN 2:39" />A̱ca̱pa̱ a̱ wu, tsugono tso ro tsa̱ ta̱ 'yon, waa rawa za va̱ wu shi. Waru, tsugono tso ro tsa ta'atsu vu rumushili ta yuwan tsugono tsu uvaɗi suru. <verse eid="DAN 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DAN 2:40" />Reve waru tsugono tsa̱ na̱shi tsa̱ ta̱wa̱, ugbamu tsu rumu-adama a na rumu tsu ɓatsa ta̱ a̱vu wu mura ili biti-waru cine rumu tsu minjira ili muɓaci muɓaci, ne ɗa waa minjira akapi a na a buwai. <verse eid="DAN 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DAN 2:41" />Waru cine ve enei apata a ana na akatsu a ana akapi o olo'o akapi waru a̱ rumu, a̱yi nda u to o'wo tsugono tsa na tsa ɓatsalai, agba u ta buwa na̱ macira ma̱ rumu a̱tsuma̱ a̱ yi, cine ve enei rumu uɓoluloi no olo'o. <verse eid="DAN 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DAN 2:42" />Cine akapi a akatsu'u a̱ ri e irumu na akapi o olo'o, ne ɗa tsugono tsa nda tsoo o'wo upasu u na nu ucira akapi waru babu ucira. <verse eid="DAN 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DAN 2:43" />Waru cine ve enei rumu uɓolu no olo'o, ne ɗa ama a̱a̱ ja̱mba̱ra̱la̱i na̱ nzuwulai aa buwa aci a̱ ta̱ shi cine vu revei rumu voo ɓoluloi no olo'o shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 2:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DAN 2:44" />&lt;&lt;A mantsa mo ngono n ndolo, A̱sula̱ a zuva a̱ ta̱ 'ya̱sa̱n tsugono tsa na tsa̱a̱ riya̱ shi, ko a lyawaa ama o ro shi. U ta minjira akapi o tsugono tso ndolo reve u rawato le utyo suru suru, agba a̱yi tsugono tsa nda a aciya̱yi wa̱a̱ riya̱ shi. <verse eid="DAN 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DAN 2:45" />Cine ve enei a ɓatsai aatali diga a masasan agba nu ukere u vuma shi-aatali a na o ɓosoi rumu'u na̱ rumushili no olo'o na̱ azurufa na̱ zinariya'a muɓaci muɓaci, A̱sula̱ a gbain o roco ta̱ mogono ili i na yaa fara elime. Alavu'u ne ɗa u ri, ucuɗuwu wa̱ yi waru amayun a ɗa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="DAN 2:46" />Reve Nebukanaza mogono ma̱ riya̱ ma̱kpa̱ɓa̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma Daniya a̱vu u ca yi tsugbain, a̱vu u zuwa a yuwaan Daniya kucci na̱ a̱tsuka̱ a̱ ma̱guru. <verse eid="DAN 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DAN 2:47" />Reve u damma Daniya, &lt;&lt;Amayun a ɗa A̱sula̱ a̱ wu a̱yi ɗa A̱sula̱ a̱ musula̱ na̱ Zagbain vu ngono, na̱ za na tsu pa̱lu'wa̱ ili yu usokowu, adama a na vu gura pa̱lu'wa̱i ili yu usokowu i nda.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 2:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="DAN 2:48" />Reve mogono ma ca Daniya tsugbain lon a̱vu u ca yi ne'e gbagbain va̱ a̱bunda̱ lon. A̱vu waru u ca yi tsugbain tsu upasu wa Babila suru, a̱vu u zuwa yi wo o'wo aci a̱ a̱za̱ o urevu wa aza a Babila suru. <verse eid="DAN 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DAN 2:49" />Reve Daniya pati mogono a̱vu u zuwa Shadra na̱ Meshe na̱ Abenego aza a na a̱ ri n ka̱lyuwusa̱ upasu wa Babila, Daniya gba na aciya̱yi wi isawan pe o ukobu u mogono.<verse eid="DAN 2:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DAN 3" />
  <para style="s">A̱ma̱li a zinariya a Nebukanaza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 3:1" />Mogono Nebukanaza ruma ta̱ uruma u zinariya uga'an wa̱ yi ana kupakucci, washin wa̱ yi ana kucci. Reve u shuwa̱ yi a agalaci a Dura upasu wa Babila. <verse eid="DAN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 3:2" />Reve Mogono Nebukanaza ma zuwa o ɓoloto azagbain a pasu vi iɗa na aza a tsugbain na̱ nan gwamna na̱ a̱za̱ o ucasu wa̱ a̱sa̱la̱ na̱ a̱za̱ e izuwa na̱ a̱za̱ o uge'etosu na aza a mapaɗa mo ugana na azagbain a pasu vi iɗa suru, a̱ ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ a̱buki o ucasu wa̱ a̱ma̱li a na u shuwa̱i.<verse eid="DAN 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 3:3" />Ɗaɗa azagbain e iɗa na aza a tsugbain na̱ nan gwamna na̱ a̱za̱ o ucasu wa̱ a̱sa̱la̱ na̱ a̱za̱ e izuwa na̱ a̱za̱ o uge'etosu na aza a mapaɗa mo ugana na azagbain a pasu vi iɗa'a suru o ɓolotoi adama a̱ a̱buki o ucasu wu uruma u na Mogono Nebukanaza shuwa̱i. Reve e isawan elime a̱ yi.<verse eid="DAN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 3:4" />Reve ajiya a lapa ulingi nu uɗyo wu ucira, &lt;&lt;Apa nda ili a na a zuwa nɗu i yuwan, ama na̱ nɗa ne elentsu suru: <verse eid="DAN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 3:5" />A mantsa ma na yu uwwai mesun ma aavana na̱ za vu gbala na̱ kumburu ni iwakacau na̱ cu'un wivulu suru na̱ cu'un vi iwa'ashi biti, reve i riya̱ e iɗa i yuwaan uruma u zinariya u na Mogono Nebukanaza shuwa̱i a̱ga̱nda̱. <verse eid="DAN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 3:6" />Za na suru kuɗa̱i a̱ riya̱ e iɗa u yuwan a̱ga̱nda̱ a ta varishi niyi a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱a̱ka̱ri a akina a̱ ma̱kula̱ mo usuɗuwu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="DAN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 3:7" />Adama o ndolo na ama a uwwushi mesun ma aavana na̱ za vu gbala na̱ kumburu ni iwakacau na̱ cu'un wivulu suru na̱ cu'un vi iwa'ashi biti, reve ama'a suru na̱ nɗa ne elentsu suru a̱ riya̱ e iɗa a yuwaan uruma u zinariya u na Mogono Nebukanaza ma̱ shuwa̱i'i a̱ga̱nda̱.<verse eid="DAN 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 3:8" />A mantsa mo ndolo reve aza a avasa a̱ a̱ma̱li o ro a ta̱wa̱ a yuwan adanshi a vama a aci a mmaci ma Ibrahim. <verse eid="DAN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 3:9" />A̱vu a damma Mogono Nebukanaza, &lt;&lt;Mogono wuma wa̱ wu u jima! <verse eid="DAN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 3:10" />Vu yuwan ta̱ udammu, a na vuma na suru uwwai mesun ma aavana na̱ za vu gbala na̱ kumburu ni iwakacau na̱ cu'un wivulu suru na̱ cu'un vi iwa'ashi biti, a̱ riya̱ e iɗa a yuwaan uruma u zinariya'a a̱ga̱nda̱. <verse eid="DAN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 3:11" />Agba za na suru riya̱i a̱vu u yuwan a̱ga̱nda̱ shi a ta vari yi a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱a̱ka̱ri a akina a̱ ma̱kula̱ mo usuɗawu. <verse eid="DAN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 3:12" />Agba mmaci ma Ibrahim n na vu zuwai tsugbain tsu upasu wa Babila-Shadra na̱ Meshe na̱ Abenego, a zuwaa wu atsuvu shi, Mogono. Aa yuwusaan musula̱ ma̱ wu tsugbashi ko a yuwaan uruma u zinariya u na vu shuwa̱i a̱ga̱nda̱ shi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="DAN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 3:13" />Reve a̱tsuma̱ o upan lon, Nebukanaza zuwa a̱ ta̱wa̱ na̱ Shadra na̱ Meshe na̱ Abenego. Ɗaɗa a̱ ta̱wa̱i ne ele a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n mo mogono. <verse eid="DAN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 3:14" />Reve Nebukanaza damma le, &lt;&lt;Amayun a ɗa Shadra na̱ Meshe na̱ Abenego, a na yaa yuwusaan musula̱ n va̱ tsugbashi ko i yuwaan uruma u zinariya u na n shuwa̱i a̱ga̱nda̱ shi? <verse eid="DAN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 3:15" />Gogo nda ni i tu ufoɓu, na̱ yu uwwa mesun ma aavana na̱ za vu gbala na̱ kumburu ni iwakacau na̱ cu'un wivulu suru na̱ cu'un vi iwa'ashi biti, i riya̱ e iɗa i yuwaan uruma u zinariya u na n shuwa̱i a̱ga̱nda̱ u lobono ta̱. Agba ni i 'yuwan a yuwaan yi a̱ga̱nda̱, a ta varishi nɗu a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱a̱ka̱ri a akina a̱ ma̱kula̱ o usuɗawu. Reve tse ene ma̱sula̱ ma na maa gura wawa ɗu e ekere a̱ va̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="DAN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 3:16" />Reve Shadra na̱ Meshe na̱ Abenego a̱ usu mogono, &lt;&lt;Nebukanaza, tsu ri n na tsa̱a̱ piriya̱a̱ aciya̱tsu ya̱'a̱ wu a̱tsuma̱ a addama a nda shi. <verse eid="DAN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 3:17" />Nna a vari tsu a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱a̱ka̱ri a akina a̱ ma̱kula̱ mo usuɗawu, A̱sula̱ a na tsaa yuwusaan tsugbashi u ta gura wawa tsu pe, reve u papa tsu e ekere a̱ wu mogono. <verse eid="DAN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 3:18" />Agba ko nu u wawa tsu shi, tsu ta ciga wu vu reve mogono, a na tsaa yuwaan musula̱ ma̱ wu tsugbashi shi ko tsu yuwaan uruma u zinariya u na vu shuwa̱i a̱ga̱nda̱ shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 3:19" />Reve Nebukanaza tsutsa nu upan wa Shadra na̱ Meshe na̱ Abenego reve urewesu wa̱ yi u vadala. A̱vu u zuwa a̱ fa̱la̱ akina'a u suɗuwa toto ucindere ulawu na̱ cine u tsu da̱na̱. <verse eid="DAN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 3:20" />Reve u zuwa a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱soja a na a la'ai ucira a̱ nla̱ Shadra na̱ Meshe na̱ Abenego, reve a vari le a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱a̱ka̱ri a akina a̱ ma̱kula̱ mo usuɗawu. <verse eid="DAN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 3:21" />Reve a̱ nla̱ le wotowu na̱ a̱tugu e le na acaka e le no okokolo e le na akapi e itana i lipu i le, a̱vu a vari le a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱a̱ka̱ri a akina a̱ ma̱kula̱ꞌa̱. <verse eid="DAN 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 3:22" />Udammu o mogono u suɗuwa ta̱ lon akina'a waru a suɗuwa ta̱ lon hali elentsu a akina'a o una a̱soja a na a variyi Shadra na̱ Meshe na̱ Abenego'o. <verse eid="DAN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 3:23" />Reve ama a ta'atsu a nda Shadra na̱ Meshe na̱ Abenego a̱ riya̱ pe a akina'a wunlu kamkam.<verse eid="DAN 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 3:24" />Reve Mogono Nebukanaza ma̱ 'yoshin mishin adama e ili ya asalama i na we enei, a̱vu we ece aza a na aa casu yi a̱sa̱la̱, &lt;&lt;Ama a ta'atsu a ɗa tsu nla̱i reve tsu vari le a akina shi?&gt;&gt; Reve a̱ usu, &lt;&lt;Ne ɗa mogono.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 3:25" />A̱vu u saala, &lt;&lt;Ka̱lyuwa̱i! N te inda ama a̱ na̱shi uba̱ɗu a mmalu e memere ma akina'a, agba ko ili i yuwan le shi, waru za va̱ na̱shi'i u rotso ta̱ mawun ma̱ musula̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="DAN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 3:26" />Reve Nebukanaza rawa zuzu nu una̱ntsu wa̱ a̱a̱ka̱ri a akina a̱ ma̱kula̱ꞌa̱ a̱vu u saala, &lt;&lt;Shadra na̱ Meshe na̱ Abenego, agbashi o Mogono ma̱ A̱sula̱, uta̱i! Ta̱wa̱i pa nda!&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa Shadra na̱ Meshe na̱ Abenego o uta̱i a akina'a. <verse eid="DAN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 3:27" />Reve azagbain e iɗa na azagbain na̱ nan gwamna na aza a na aa casu mogono a̱sa̱la̱ o ɓoloto uka̱nda̱ruwu ne ele. Reve e ene akina'a u ju'wa̱in lipu le shi waru ko a̱nji e le a kpara shi; a̱tugu e le waru a̱ kula̱ shi, agba ko a̱'ya̱n a̱ mikyon a̱ ri a̱ lipu le shi.<verse eid="DAN 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 3:28" />Reve Nebukanaza damma, &lt;&lt;Aba'un za va̱ A̱sula̱ a Shadra na̱ Meshe na̱ Abenego ɗa, za na lyunguyi malingata ma̱ yi a̱vu u wawa agbashi a̱ yi! A zuwa ta̱ ucira u le ya̱'a̱ yi a̱vu a 'yuwan a̱ kuru adanshi o mogono, a̱vu a ca wuma u le o una̱ u na aa yuwaan ma̱sula̱ mo ro tsugbashi ko a yuwaan yi a̱ga̱nda̱ she A̱sula̱ e le goon. <verse eid="DAN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 3:29" />Adama o ndolo n zuwa ta̱ wila̱ a na ama ko iɗa ko elentsu a na suru a yuwain adanshi a vama o ro a̱ tyo e ekere a̱ A̱sula̱ a Shadra na̱ Meshe na̱ Abenego o to koɗo le mukoɗi mukoɗi reve a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ 'wa le okongo, adama a na a̱sula̱ o ro o lo a na aa gura wawa ne tsunda shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 3:30" />Reve mogono ma̱ da̱shi Shadra na̱ Meshe na̱ Abenego tsugbain a̱tsuma̱ o upasu wi iɗa wa Babila.<verse eid="DAN 3:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DAN 4" />
  <para style="s">Alavu a Nebukanaza o uɗanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 4:1" />Diga yo Mogono Nebukanaza, a̱ tyo ya ama na̱ nɗa ne elentsu biti, a na a̱ ri a̱tsuma̱ o uvaɗi suru: Lyawa i tsura̱ ulyuwu we elime diga!<verse eid="DAN 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 4:2" />Me ene ta̱ u lobono ta̱ n damma ɗu iroci ya asalama i na Mogono ma̱ A̱sula̱ ma yuwaan numu. <verse eid="DAN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 4:3" />Cine tsa ɗa mgbain mi iroci ma̱ yi, cine tsa ɗa ucira wi ili ya asalama ya̱ yi! Tsugono tsa̱ yi tsa̱ ri nu ukotu shi; tsugbain tsa̱ yi tsa̱ ta̱ lo diga mantsa a̱ tyo mantsa. <verse eid="DAN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 4:4" />A̱mu Nebukanaza, a̱mu a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa u va̱ a uwwusa uyo'o waru a lyuwusa elime o ukobu u tsugono tsa̱ va̱, <verse eid="DAN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 4:5" />a̱vu n yuwan alavu a na a ca numu wovon. A̱mu nven a̱ a̱ga̱da̱ a̱ va̱, alavu na̱ majiyan ma na n yuwain a zuwa mu ta̱ tsuda'un. <verse eid="DAN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 4:6" />Ɗaɗa n zuwai o ɓolotowo mu a̱za̱ o urevu a Babila suru adama a cuɗuwa mu alavu'u. <verse eid="DAN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 4:7" />Ana ozo o tsuboci na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ yindi na a̱za̱ a̱ o urevu na aza a avasa a̱ a̱ma̱li a̱ ta̱wa̱i, a̱vu n damma le alavu'u, agba a gura cuɗuwa mu yi shi. <verse eid="DAN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 4:8" />O ukosu, reve Daniya ta̱wa̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ va̱, reve n damma yi alavu a̱ va̱. (A̱yi ɗa za na a cayi aala Belteshaza na aala a̱ ma̱sula̱ ma̱ va̱, waru ruhu musula̱ va akiza ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ yi.) <verse eid="DAN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 4:9" />A̱vu n damma yi, &lt;&lt;Belteshaza, mogono ma̱ a̱za̱ a̱ yindi, n reve ta̱ a na ruhu musula̱ ma akiza ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ wu, waru babu ili yu usokowu i na i la'ai ucira wa̱ wu. Apa nda alavu a̱ va̱ damma mu ucuɗuwu wa̱ yi. <verse eid="DAN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 4:10" />Alavu a na me enei a̱mu nven a̱ a̱ga̱da̱ a̱ va̱ a ɗa nda: N ka̱lyuwa̱ ta̱ reve me ene uɗanga mishin elime a̱ va̱ e memere mo uvaɗi. U shi ta̱ uga'an lon. <verse eid="DAN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 4:11" />Reve uɗanga'a u reme a yuwusan mgbain nu ucira a̱vu aaci a̱ yi a̱ ju'wa̱in zuva; a ta gura ene yi ko te ɗa a̱tsuma̱ o uvaɗi. <verse eid="DAN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 4:12" />A̱vu'un a̱ yi ulobonu, muwun ma̱ yi waru a̱bunda̱ lon, a ta gura lyuwato ama suru. Za̱la̱ o ululu wa̱ yi u ɗa inama yu una yee ivuwusan. Nnunu n tsu'yan waru aa yuwusan nkinda e eten a̱ yi, diga ya̱'a̱ yi ɗa ili i wuma biti yaa lyuwusa. <verse eid="DAN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 4:13" />A̱tsuma̱ a alavu alavu'u a̱mu nven a̱ a̱ga̱da̱ a̱ va̱, n ka̱lyuwa̱ ta̱ a̱vu me ene malingata a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ va̱, za va akiza, a̱ cipusa̱ diga zuva. <verse eid="DAN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 4:14" />A̱vu u damma nu uɗyo zuva, &lt;Koɗo uɗanga'a a̱vu o koɗo eten a̱ yi, a saza a̱vu'un a̱ yi suru a̱vu a zaza muwun ma̱ yi. Lyawa inama i bete'we za̱la̱ va̱ yi nnunu waru mu 'yawan e eten a̱ yi. <verse eid="DAN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 4:15" />Agba a lyawa ikyun na aralu a̱ yi e iɗa wunlu na̱ rumu na̱ rumushili a̱tsuma̱ a anlya o uta̱nu a atsusa. Lyawa u re'we na a'iza diga zuva, reve u da̱nu oɓolo ni inama yu una a̱tsuma̱ a anlya. <verse eid="DAN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 4:16" />Lyawa a vadala okolo a̱ yi a vaɗilima̱ a̱vu wo o'wo no okolo a nama, hali she na̱ mantsa me cindere ma̱ ka̱ra̱ a aci a̱ yi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 4:17" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Nlingata n ɗa n dammai ili i nda, a̱sa̱la̱ a na aza a akiza a tarai, adama aza a wuma e reve a na A̱sulazuva Mogono ma̱ A̱sula̱ ma ɗa za tsugbain tsa ama waru u tsu ca ta̱ za na suru u cigai u ca. Reve u zuwaa le za na ri ili i ro shi suru suru.&gt; <verse eid="DAN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 4:18" />A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa alavu a na a̱mu Mogono Nebukanaza n yuwain. Gogo nda Belteshaza, damma mu ucuɗuwu wa̱ yi, adama a na ko vuma ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱za̱ o urevu o tsugono tsa̱ va̱ aa gura cuɗuwa mu yi shi. Agba a̱vu vu ta gura adama a na ruhu ma̱sula̱ ma akiza ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daniya cuɗuwa ta̱ alavu'u</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 4:19" />Reve Daniya (za na waru a̱ tsu ɗe Belteshaza) wo o'wo kuci kuci ne'en adama a na majiyan ma̱ yi ma ca niyi wovon. Ɗaɗa mogono ma dammai, &lt;&lt;Belteshaza, she vu lyawa alavu'u ko ucuɗuwu wa̱ yi u ca wu wovon wan.&gt;&gt; A̱vu Belteshaza usu, &lt;&lt;Zagbain va̱, na aa damma alavu'u nu ucuɗuwu wa̱ yi u to o'wo a aci a aza a na a 'yuwan nuwu! <verse eid="DAN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 4:20" />Uɗanga u na ve enei za na yuwain mgbain nu ucira, na ncilecile ma̱ yi n ju'wa̱n zuva, za na uvaɗi suru we inda, <verse eid="DAN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 4:21" />na̱ a̱vu'un a sa'ani na̱ muwun ma̱ a̱bunda̱, za na ili suru yaa lyuwusa, a casu inama yu una ululu, nu uba̱ta̱ wu nkinda wu nnunu n tsu'yan e eten a̱ yi- <verse eid="DAN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 4:22" />Mogono, a̱vu ɗaɗa uɗanga'a! Vo o'wo ta̱ zagbain nu ucira; tsugbain tsa̱ wu tsa kungwa ta̱ hali u rawa zuva, reve waru tsugbain tsa̱ wu tsa rawa ba̱ta̱ ba̱ta̱ va alanga o uvaɗi. <verse eid="DAN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 4:23" />Mogono me ene ta̱ malingata, za va akiza, a̱ cipa̱ diga zuva a dansa, &lt;Koɗo uɗanga'a reve o kototo yi, agba a lyawa ikyu'un wunlu na̱ rumu na̱ rumushili, a̱tsuma̱ a anlya a atsusa, na aralu a̱ yi pe e iɗa. Lyawa u re'we na a'iza a zuva; lyawa u da̱nu tsi inama yu una, hali she na̱ mantsa me cindere ma̱ ka̱ra̱ a aci a̱ yi.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="DAN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 4:24" />&lt;&lt;Apa nda ucuɗuwu'u, Mogono, waru apa ili i na Mogono ma̱ A̱sula̱ ma zuwai a aci a zagbain va̱ mogono: <verse eid="DAN 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 4:25" />A̱ ta̱ gba̱ra̱ wu diga a̱tsuma̱ a ama, reve vu da̱nu ni inama yu una; vu ta tama wunlya tsi inan a̱vu vu re'we na a'iza a zuva. Mantsa me cindere ma̱ ta̱ ka̱ra̱ a aci a̱ wu, hali she mantsa ma na vu revei Mogono ma̱ A̱sula̱ a̱yi ɗa Mogono ma Gbain e ekere o tsugono tsa ama, waru u tsu ca ta̱ za na suru u cigai u ca. <verse eid="DAN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 4:26" />Agba a na a zuwai a lyawa ikyun na aralu o uɗanga'a, u to rocosu a̱ ta̱ ka̱mbuwa̱a̱ wu tsugono tsa̱ wu a mantsa ma na vu revei a na Zuva ɗa aa yuwusan tsugbain. <verse eid="DAN 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 4:27" />Adama o ndolo, Mogono, vu yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱ vu usu a̱sa̱la̱ a̱ va̱: Vu lyawa unusu wa̱ wu vu yuwan ili i mejege, waru vu lyawa iwuya ya̱ wu e ekere o urocosu wi isa'ani a̱ tyo ya aza a na oo ɓongishi. U ta gura o'wo ne ɗa ulyuwu wa aci wa̱ wu waa lyuwa elime.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alavu'u a shiwan ta̱</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 4:28" />Ili i nda suru i cina ta̱ Nebukanaza Mogono. <verse eid="DAN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 4:29" />Ana a yuwain woto kupa ne ejere, mogono a mmalu zuva vu ukobu u tsugono tsa Babila, <verse eid="DAN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 4:30" />a̱vu u damma, &lt;&lt;A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa Babila gbain na n suwai wo o'wo uba̱ta̱ wu nden u tsugono shi, nu ucira u va̱ adama a tsugbain a tsugbain tsa̱ va̱ shi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="DAN 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 4:31" />A̱yi ubuwu a adanshi, reve uɗyo wu uta̱ diga zuva, &lt;&lt;Mogono Nebukanaza, apa ili i na o paɗaa nuwu: A kasa wu ta̱ nu ucira u tsugbain tsa̱ wu. <verse eid="DAN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 4:32" />O to lo wu diga a̱tsuma̱ a ama reve vu da̱nu oɓolo ni inama yu una; vu ta tama wunlya tsi inan. Mantsa me cindere ma̱ ta̱ ka̱ra̱ a aci a̱ wu, hali she mantsa ma na vu revei Mogono ma̱ A̱sula̱ a̱yi mogono e ekere o tsugono tsa ama, waru u tsu ca ta̱ za na suru u cigai u ca.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="DAN 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 4:33" />Reve ili i na a dammai e ekere a Nebukanaza i shiwushin. A̱ gba̱ra̱ yi ta̱ diga a̱tsuma̱ a ama, reve u tama wunlya tsi inan. A̱vu e re'wetyo lipu va̱ yi na a'iza a zuva reve a̱nji a̱ yi a yuwan uga'an tsa ashi'in a̱ a̱kuru a̱kpa̱ta̱ a̱ yi waru tsa̱ a̱kpa̱ta̱ a manunu. <verse eid="DAN 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 4:34" />O ukosu u mantsa mo ndolo, a̱mu, Nebukanaza, n 'ya̱sa̱n ta̱ esu a̱ va̱ zuva, reve a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱a̱ mu nu ugbozu u va̱. Reve n ciɓala Mogono ma̱ A̱sula̱ n ca yi tsugbain za na ri wuma hali hali hali. Tsugono tsa̱ yi tsa̱ ri nu ukotu shi; Tsugbain tsa̱ yi diga a mantsa hali a̱ tyo mantsa ma ɗa u ri. <verse eid="DAN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 4:35" />Ama o uvaɗi suru ili i ro i ɗa shi. U tsu yuwan ta̱ cine u cigai na̱ cira va zuva na ama o uvaɗi. Ko za aa gura geshe yi ukere shi ko we ece yi, &lt;&lt;Nye vu yuwain shi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="DAN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 4:36" />A mantsa ma na a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱a̱ numu ugbozu u va̱'a̱, tsugbain tsa̱ va̱ na̱ mawwa mo uyo'o ma̱ va̱ fo a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱a̱ mu ta̱ adama a tsugbain tsu uba̱ta̱ u tsugono tsa̱ va̱. A̱za̱ o ucasu wa̱ a̱sa̱la̱ na azagbain a̱ va̱ a zami mu ta̱, reve a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱a̱ mu o ootogu o tsugono tsa̱ va̱, hali gba a̱ da̱shi mu tsugbain tsa na tsa la'ai tsu ufaru. <verse eid="DAN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 4:37" />Gogo nda, a̱mu Nebukanaza, n cuwa ta̱ reve n ca Mogono ma zuva tsugbain, adama a na ili i na suru waa yuwusan a̱ ta̱ mejege waru ure wa̱ yi suru amayun a ɗa. Waru aza a na a̱ ri a mmalu nu uvaɗu u ta gura ka̱ɗa̱to le.<verse eid="DAN 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DAN 5" />
  <para style="s">Iɗana o uɓaɓu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 5:1" />Urana u ro Mogono Belshaza mo foɓo ta̱ a̱ba̱jini a̱ a̱buki adama a azagbain a̱ yi ele ama ukpakukupa (1,000). Mogono mo sowo ta̱ masayan ma̱ ina̱bi oɓolo ne ele. <verse eid="DAN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 5:2" />Ana Belshaza peɗei masayan ma̱ ina̱bi mo ndolo, reve u zuwa a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ mukoto n zinariya na aza a azurufa adama a aciya̱yi na azagbain a̱ yi, na̱ a̱ma̱ci a̱ yi oɓolo na̱ a̱ma̱ci a̱ nge'en, adama o sowoo. Mukoto n ndolo gba a̱ ta̱ pe a̱tsuma̱ e ili i na Nebukanaza dada va̱ yi pura̱i a̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa Urishelima. <verse eid="DAN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 5:3" />A̱vu a̱ ta̱wa̱ na̱ mukoto n zinariya n na a̱ pura̱i a̱tsuma̱ a̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sula̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima, a̱vu a̱yi mogono na azagbain a̱ yi, na̱ a̱ma̱ci a̱ yi oɓolo na̱ a̱ma̱ci a̱ nge'en a̱ yi o sowo ne ele. <verse eid="DAN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 5:4" />Ana o sowoi masayan ma̱ ina̱bi'i, a̱vu e reme a cuwusa musula̱ n le n na a yuwain na̱ zinariya na̱ azurufa oɓolo na̱ rumushili, ni irumu na̱ ɗanga oɓolo na atali.<verse eid="DAN 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 5:5" />Babu urevu ɗaɗa e enei akatsu a vuma o uta̱i a yuwusan iɗana uba̱ta̱ u na a surai o uɓaɓu wu ukobu u mogono, a̱ nka̱la̱la̱i na̱ wisawatan u fitila. Mogono me ene ta̱ ukere'e e iɗana. <verse eid="DAN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 5:6" />A̱vu urewesu u mogono u lukuta̱. A̱vu majiyan ma̱ yi ma ca yi wovon. Reve waru a̱la̱ta̱ a̱ lipu va̱ yi a̱ kuwa̱. A̱vu a̱lu a̱ yi waru e reme ugamulai.<verse eid="DAN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 5:7" />A̱vu mogono ma yuwan ɗewu na̱ a̱ba̱jini o uɗyo a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ yindi, na̱ a̱za̱ o urevu na aza a avasa a̱ a̱ma̱li. Ɗaɗa u yuwain adanshi na̱ a̱za̱ o urevu'u u damma, &lt;&lt;Za na suru gura ɗeyinuna̱ iɗana i nda, reve u gura damma mu urevu wa̱ yi suru, to, o oto yi utugu wu shili u ma̱ɗiya̱, a̱vu o oto yi iliyinlu i zinariya, a̱ ta̱ waru a ca yi wo o'wo zagbain ta'atsu a̱tsuma̱ a tsugbain tsugono'o.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 5:8" />A̱vu a̱za̱ o urevu o mogono'o suru a uwa, agba a gura ɗenuna̱ iɗana'a shi ko a gura damma yi urevu wi ili'i shi. <verse eid="DAN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 5:9" />A̱vu Mogono Belshaza ma da'wan lon, reve urewesu wa̱ yi u lukuta̱. Reve fo azagbain a̱ yi a̱ ra̱pula̱.<verse eid="DAN 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 5:10" />A̱vu ana Egbere mma mogono ma uwwai uɗyo u mogono oɓolo na azagbain a̱ yi, a̱vu u ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ a̱buki'i, reve u damma, &lt;&lt;Wuma wa̱ wu u jima mogono! She vu da'wan wan. Waru she vu lukuta̱ urewesu wan! <verse eid="DAN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 5:11" />Vuma ro ta̱ pe a̱tsuma̱ o tsugono tsa̱ wu u ta̱ na̱ ruhu musula̱ ma̱ akiza a̱tsuma̱ a̱ yi. A rana va dada va̱ wu, a cina yi ta̱ nu urevu nu uguru nu ugbozu cine vu revei musula̱. Mogono Nebukanaza dada va̱ wu, dada va̱ wu mogono, u zuwa yi ta̱ wo o'wo zagbain va̱ a̱za̱ a̱ yindi, no ozo o tsuboci na̱ a̱za̱ o urevu na aza a avasa a̱ a̱ma̱li. <verse eid="DAN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 5:12" />A̱yi vuma nda Daniya, za na mogono ma cayi aala Belteshaza, a̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ e reve a na u ri na̱ ruhu vu urevu nu urevu nu uguru. Waru u ta̱ nu uguru u na waa cuɗuwa alavu, waru u cuɗuwa oroci e yitele, a̱vu waru u gura pa̱lu'wa̱ ili i na i ri usa̱n. Ɗeyi Daniya, u ta gura damma urevu wi iɗana i nda.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 5:13" />Ɗaɗa a̱ ta̱wa̱i na̱ Daniya a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n mo mogono. Reve mogono me ece Daniya, &lt;&lt;A̱vu ɗaɗa Daniya'a, a̱tsuma̱ a aza a na dada va̱ pura̱i diga Yahuda'a? <verse eid="DAN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 5:14" />Mu uwwa ta̱ a na ruhu musula̱ n to oɓolo na̱ a̱vu waru vu ta̱ nu uguru, waru vu ta̱ nu ugbozu u na u ka̱ra̱la̱i. <verse eid="DAN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 5:15" />A̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ mu ta̱ na aza a na a̱ ri nu ugbozu na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ yindi tsa̱ra̱ e ɗe iɗana i nda, nu una̱ agba ele a gura reve shi, a gura ca mu ucuɗuwu wi ili i na i ri uɗanu shi. <verse eid="DAN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 5:16" />Mu uwwa ta̱ na vu tsu gura ta̱ cuɗuwa waru vu tsu gura ta̱ kakasa addama o usa̱n. Na̱ vu gura ɗe iɗana i nda nu una̱, waru vu gura cuɗuwa mu urevu wa̱ yi, to, o to oto wu utugu u tsugono u shili u ma̱ɗiya̱ reve o oto wu iliyinlu i zinariya. A ta ca wu tsugbain tsa ta'atsu a̱tsuma̱ o tsugono tsa nda.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 5:17" />Reve Daniya usu mogono, &lt;&lt;Wuma wa̱ wu u jima! Vu ta gura ɓa̱na̱ ne'e va̱ wu, ko vu ca nanza. Na̱ ne suru n ta ɗewe wu nu una̱ iɗana i nda, a̱vu n cuɗuwa wu urevu wa̱ yi. <verse eid="DAN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 5:18" />Mogono, Mogono ma̱ A̱sula̱ ma ɗa ma cayi dada va̱ wu Nebukanaza tsugono na̱ tsugbain reve waru u 'ya̱sa̱n yi zuva. <verse eid="DAN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 5:19" />Waru adama a tsugbain tsa na u ca niyi, a̱vu ama suru, na̱ nɗa ne elentsu a uwwa wovon waru e je'en lipu a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ yi. Aza a na u cigai wu una a̱vu wu una, aza a na u cigai u lyawa wuma a̱vu u lyawa le wuma, aza a na u cigai u 'ya̱sa̱n le zuva a̱vu u 'ya̱sa̱n le zuva aza a na waru u cigai u ka̱ɗa̱to e iɗa a̱vu u ka̱ɗa̱to le e iɗa. <verse eid="DAN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 5:20" />Ana okolo a̱ yi a gbawai a̱vu wo o'wo tapu nu uvaɗu, a̱vu a̱ cipa̱to yi o ootogu o tsugono'o, a̱vu waru a kasa yi na̱ tsugbain tsa̱ yi. <verse eid="DAN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 5:21" />A̱vu a̱ gba̱ra̱ yi a̱tsuma̱ a ama reve a ca yi okolo a nama vu una, a̱vu u da̱nu oɓolo na̱ nloli mu una a̱vu u tamusa anlya tsi inan, a̱vu waru lipu va̱ yi re'we na a'iza a zuva, she na u ta̱wa̱ u revei na Mogono ma̱ A̱sula̱ ma ɗa maa yuwusan tsugbain e ekere o tsugono tsa ama, waru u tsu ca ta̱ za na suru u cigai u ca.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 5:22" />&lt;&lt;Amma a̱vu gba mawun ma̱ yi, Belshaza, koto vu ka̱ɗa̱to aciya̱wu shi, ko na vu revei ili i nda biti. <verse eid="DAN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 5:23" />Ana vaa yuwan tsundolo, a̱vu vu rocowo Zagbain va zuva ugbawu, a̱vu vu zuwa a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ wu na̱ mukoto n na n ri pe a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa wa̱ yi. A̱vu na azagbain a̱ wu, oɓolo na̱ a̱ma̱ci a̱ wu na̱ a̱ma̱ci a̱ nge'en a̱ wu a̱vu i sowo ne ele. A̱vu i cuwa musula̱ n zinariya na aza a azurufa, na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ rumushili ni irumu oɓolo na̱ ɗanga na atali, aza a na a tsu gura ene shi agba a uwwa shi ko e reve ili i ro. Agba vu ca A̱sula̱ za na wuma wa̱ wu na̱ re va̱ wu ri e ekere a̱ yi tsugbain shi. <verse eid="DAN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 5:24" />A̱yi ɗa ili i na i zuwai A̱sulazuva a̱ lyunguyi ukere u ndolo u yuwan iɗana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 5:25" />&lt;&lt;Apa nda iɗana i na a yuwain: MENE, MENE, TEKEL, NA̱ PASHI.<verse eid="DAN 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 5:26" />&lt;&lt;Apa urevu wi idanshi'i, MENE: A̱sula̱ e kece ta̱ rana tsugono tsa̱ wu a̱vu u ta̱wa̱to le o ukosu.<verse eid="DAN 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 5:27" />&lt;&lt;TEKEL: O rito ta̱ ume wa̱ wu e ili yu uritosu a̱vu a cina wu vu ka̱la̱ma̱.<verse eid="DAN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 5:28" />&lt;&lt;PERES: E eneshe ta̱ tsugono tsa̱ wu a̱vu a ca aza a Midiya na aza a Pashiya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 5:29" />Babu usa̱n a̱vu mogono Belshaza zuwa o oto Daniya utugu wu ushili u ma̱ɗiya̱ a̱vu waru o oto yi iliyinlu i zinariya. A̱vu a lapa ulingi a na a ca yi ta̱ tsugbain tsa ta'atsu a̱tsuma̱ o tsugono tsi iɗa'a.<verse eid="DAN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 5:30" />A̱tsuma̱ a ayin o ndolo a ɗa o unai Belshaza, mogono ma Babila. <verse eid="DAN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 5:31" />A̱vu Dariyu vuma va Midiya ushi tsugono'o a̱yi na a'wan kupota̱li ne ejere.<verse eid="DAN 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DAN 6" />
  <para style="s">Daniya a̱ a̱a̱ka̱ri e ikamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 6:1" />Ana Dariyu o'woi mogono, we ene ta̱ u lobono ta̱ u ne'eshen tsugono'o uba̱ta̱ ukpaku nu ushin (120), reve u zuwa zagbain vi iɗa upasu suru. <verse eid="DAN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 6:2" />Reve u zuwa azagbain a ta'atsu zuva le, Daniya da̱na̱ ta̱ pe a̱tsuma̱ e le. E ekere e le ɗa akapi a azagbain aa damma cine aa yuwusan ulinga u le tsa̱ra̱ mogono ma lamba ili i ro o tsugono tsa̱ yi wan. <verse eid="DAN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 6:3" />Uba̱ta̱ u nda reve a̱yi Daniya wo o'wo ko'o na akapi a azagbain na azagbain a pasu vi iɗa, adama a na u da̱na̱i na̱ ruhu vu urevu la̱nga̱. Reve mogono ma yuwan ifoɓi cine waa ca yi tsugbain a̱tsuma̱ o tsugono'o suru. <verse eid="DAN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 6:4" />Reve ele akapi a azagbain na azagbain a pasu vi iɗa a̱ ka̱ra̱ a zamishi ure u na e reme Daniya nu unusu o ure u na waa yuwusan ulinga wa̱ yi, agba a gura tsura̱ shi. A̱ tsura̱ yi ni ili yi idaba shi, adama a na a̱yi vuma ɗa na o soɗuwoyi ma̱tsa̱n waru u tsu yuwan ta̱ ili ya̱ yi mejege, u tsu yuwan ulinga wa̱ yi nu uro shi. <verse eid="DAN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 6:5" />O ukosu a̱vu ama a nda a damma, &lt;&lt;Tsa̱a̱ tsura̱i ure u na tsee remei vuma nda Daniya nu unusu shi, she no oɓolo na̱ wila̱ u na u burai A̱sula̱ a̱ yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 6:6" />Ɗaɗa o ɓoloi aci a̱vu a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ u mogono a̱vu a damma yi, &lt;&lt;Wuma wa̱ wu u jima, Mogono Dariyu! <verse eid="DAN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 6:7" />Suru azagbain o tsugono tsa̱ wu, na aza a tsugbain, na azagbain a pasu vi iɗa, na̱ a̱za̱ o ucasu wa̱ a̱sa̱la̱ oɓolo nan gwamna a̱ sa̱la̱ ta̱ mogono ma zuwa wila̱, a̱vu vu reve o toni ta̱ wila̱ u ndolo. Wila̱ u na vaa zuwa a̱yi ɗa a̱tsuma̱ a rana mata'atsu na va̱a̱ ta̱wa̱ a̱ tyo ya̱'a̱ wu ɗa goon ama a yuwan avasa. Vuma na yuwain avasa suru a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ u vuma ro ko ma̱sula̱, agba uba̱ta̱ wa̱ wu shi, mogono, a ta vari vuma nda a̱ a̱a̱ka̱ri e ikamu. <verse eid="DAN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 6:8" />Gogo, mogono, she vu zuwa wila̱ꞌa̱, a̱vu vu zuwa ukere adama vuma gura vadala yi wan. Tsundolo tsa ɗa wo o'wo wila̱ wa Midiya na̱ Pashiya, za na babu vuma na aa gura vadala yi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="DAN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 6:9" />Ɗaɗa mogono Dariyu zuwai ukere a̱ wila̱ u na u ri uɗanu'u.<verse eid="DAN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 6:10" />Ana Daniya revei a zuwa ta̱ ukere a̱ wila̱ꞌa̱, reve u ka̱mba̱ o u'wa wa̱ yi uba̱ta̱ u na u ri nu usowoto wu upepu o u'wa wa zuva za na ri ukpa̱tu'u a̱ tyo Urishelima. Reve u kingyo na̱ a̱lu a̱ yi toto uta'atsu o urana reve u yuwan avasa u godyoo A̱sula̱, cine u yuwusain ɗe nu ufaru. <verse eid="DAN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 6:11" />A̱vu ele ama a nda a̱ ta̱wa̱ oɓolo a̱vu a cina Daniya a yuwusan avasa a̱ ta̱wusa̱ ni ipati ya̱ yi e ekere a̱ A̱sula̱. <verse eid="DAN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 6:12" />A̱vu a̱ ta̱wa̱ zuzu a̱vu a damma mogono, adama a̱ wila̱ u na a zuwai, &lt;&lt;Mogono! Ashe vu zuwa ukere adama a̱ wila̱ shi, a na za na yuwain ipati a̱ tyo a̱ ma̱sula̱ ko vuma a̱tsuma̱ a rana mata'atsu a ta vari yi a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱a̱ka̱ri e ikamu shi?&gt;&gt; A̱vu mogono ma̱ usu a̱vu u damma, &lt;&lt;Adanshi'i o ta̱ lo mishin nu ucira, cine wila̱ wa Midiya na̱ Pashiya ri, waru babu vuma na aa gura vadala yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 6:13" />Reve a̱ usu a yuwan adanshi a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n mo mogono, &lt;&lt;Daniya, za na ri a̱tsuma̱ a aza na a̱ pura̱i diga Yahuda, u zuwa atsuvu a̱ tyo ya̱'a̱ wu shi, mogono, ko wila̱ u na vu zuwai ukere, amma u ta yuwusan avasa a̱ yi uta'atsu o urana.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="DAN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 6:14" />Ana mogono ma uwwai idanshi i nda, a̱vu wo o'wo udamu a̱bunda̱ lon a̱vu u zami ure u na waa wawa Daniya. U liva̱ ta̱ a yuwusan majiyan cine wa̱a̱ tsura̱ ure u na waa wawa yi.<verse eid="DAN 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 6:15" />Reve ele ama'a a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ u mogono oɓolo reve a damma mogono, &lt;&lt;Vu cuwan, mogono, wila̱ wa Midiya na̱ Pashiya u ta̱ lo na babu vuma na aa gura vadala ili i na a̱tsuma̱ a̱ wila̱ꞌa̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 6:16" />A̱vu mogono ma zuwa a̱ ta̱wa̱ na̱ Daniya, a̱vu a vari yi a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱a̱ka̱ri e ikamu. Reve mogono ma damma Daniya, &lt;&lt;Lyawa A̱sula̱ a na vaa yuwusaan a̱ga̱nda̱ kuci u wawa wu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 6:17" />A̱vu a̱ ta̱wa̱ na aatali a̱vu o to una̱ wa̱ a̱a̱ka̱ri'i na̱ a̱yi, ɗaɗa mogono ma̱ ɓa̱ru niyi na̱ makawani mo urotsu wu ukere wa̱ yi oɓolo na̱ makawani mo urotsu we ekere wa azagbain a̱ yi, adama nanza ta̱wa̱ u vadala aɗa a Daniya wan. <verse eid="DAN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 6:18" />A̱vu mogono ma̱ ka̱mba̱ o ukobu u tsugono tsa̱ yi, reve wa asa a yuwusan akuli. A̱vu waru u 'yuwan ili i na yoo voton yi ugbozu i na a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ niyi, waru u gura lantsa shi.<verse eid="DAN 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 6:19" />Usana a tawa, reve mogono ma̱ 'yon na̱ molo a̱ tyo a̱ a̱a̱ka̱ri e ikamu'u. <verse eid="DAN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 6:20" />Ana u ta̱wa̱i zuzu na̱ a̱a̱ka̱ri uba̱ta̱ u na Daniya ri, a̱vu u saala nu uɗyo wa̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu, reve u damma Daniya, &lt;&lt;Daniya, aagbashi a̱ A̱sula̱ a wuma, ko A̱sula̱ a̱ wu za na vaa yuwusaan a̱ga̱nda̱ kuci u gura ta̱ wawa wu e ekere e ikamu'u?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 6:21" />Reve Daniya usu mogono, &lt;&lt;Mogono, wuma wa̱ wu u jima! <verse eid="DAN 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 6:22" />A̱sula̱ a̱ va̱ a̱ lyungu ta̱ malingata ma̱ yi reve u kpa̱to na̱ vi ikamu'u, waru a gura uwwato mu usa̱n shi, adama a na a̱ tsura̱ mu nu unusu e ekere a̱ yi shi. Waru koto e reme mu nu unusu e ekere a̱ wu shi mogono.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 6:23" />A̱vu mogono ma yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱ ma̱ a̱bunda̱ lon, reve u zuwa o uta̱a̱ Daniya a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱a̱ka̱ri e ikamu. Adama o ndolo ɗaɗa o uta̱yi Daniya a̱ a̱a̱ka̱ri'i, agba a cina yi na̱ wuntsu shi, adama a na u zuwayi A̱sula̱ ucira.<verse eid="DAN 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 6:24" />A̱vu mogono ma zuwa a̱ ta̱wa̱ na aza a na a yuwain epen a aci a Daniya a̱vu a vari le a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱a̱ka̱ri e ikamu oɓolo na̱ muwun n le na̱ a̱ma̱ci e le. Waru kafu a rawa o ugundo wa̱ a̱a̱ka̱ri'i, a̱vu ikamu yi keɗece le, a̱vu a kukuɗa etele e le suru suru.<verse eid="DAN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 6:25" />Ɗaɗa Mogono Dariyu ma ɗanayi ama suru na̱ nɗa ne elentsu a na a̱ ri nden o uvaɗi: &lt;&lt;Lyawa i tsura̱ ulyuwu we elime diga!<verse eid="DAN 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 6:26" />&lt;&lt;N zuwa ta̱ wila̱ a̱tsuma̱ o tsugono tsa̱ va̱ ama a ciga a 'yuwan a uwwa wovon a̱vu a yuwan tsutoni na̱ A̱sula̱ a Daniya. Adama a na a̱yi A̱sula̱ a wuma a ɗa waru u ta̱ lo babu ukotu, tsugono tsa̱ yi tsa̱ ri n kototo shi, ucira u tsugono tsa̱ yi tsa̱ ri nu utyo shi.<verse eid="DAN 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 6:27" />&lt;&lt;U tsu uta̱a̱ ta̱ reve u wawa, u tsu yuwan ta̱ iroci ni ili ya asalama zuva na̱ pa o uvaɗi, a̱yi ɗa za na wawai Daniya o ucira wi ikamu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 6:28" />Daniya tsura̱ ta̱ ulyuwu we elime a mantsa mo tsugono ma Dariyu no o tsugono tsa Sayiru za va Pashiya.<verse eid="DAN 6:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DAN 7" />
  <para style="s">Alavu alavu a Daniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 7:1" />A aa'wan o ufaru o tsugono tsa Belshaza mogono ma Babila, Daniya yuwan ta̱ alavu oɓolo na alavu alavu ana u voyin a̱ a̱a̱ga̱da̱ a̱ yi. A̱vu u ɗana ili i na we enei a̱tsuma̱ a alavu'u.<verse eid="DAN 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 7:2" />A̱vu Daniya damma, &lt;&lt;Me ene ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a alavu alavu a̱ va̱ na ayin, pepu vu pasu na̱shi va zuva a̱ lukutusa̱ a̱ba̱jini a mala. <verse eid="DAN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 7:3" />A̱vu waru inama i na̱shi yu uta̱ pe a̱tsuma̱ a mala'a, waru a tawulai ta̱ koko'o.<verse eid="DAN 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 7:4" />&lt;&lt;Za vu ufaru roco ta̱ kamu waru u da̱na̱ ta̱ ne evelu tsa̱ a̱a̱kuru. A̱mu a̱ a̱ka̱nla̱ reve a̱ mula̱ yi evelu'u, waru a̱ 'ya̱sa̱n yi ta̱ diga e iɗa a̱vu a zuwa yi wi isawan na ana tsa vuma, a̱vu a ca yi asuvu a vuma.<verse eid="DAN 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 7:5" />&lt;&lt;A̱vu me ene nama ire a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ va̱, za na rotsoi nama na a̱ tsu ɗe biya. A̱vu a̱ 'ya̱sa̱n yi upasu u ta̱, u da̱na̱ ta̱ na akambu a ta'atsu a̱tsuma̱ o una̱ wa̱ yi e memere ma anga a̱ yi. A̱vu a damma yi, &lt;'Yon vu lyuwa vu shiton a̱a̱tsuma̱ a̱ wu ni inama!&gt;<verse eid="DAN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 7:6" />&lt;&lt;Ana a̱yi ndolo kotoi a̱vu me ene a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ va̱ oroci o uta̱su, ne evelu a̱ na̱shi a manunu o ucina̱ wa̱ yi. Nama'a u da̱na̱ ta̱ na aci a̱ na̱shi, a̱vu a ca yi ucira u tsugbain.<verse eid="DAN 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 7:7" />&lt;&lt;Ana a̱yi nda kotoi a̱vu n yuwan alavu alavu na ayin, a̱vu a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ va̱ me ene nama na̱shi za vu ucira ni ili wovon lon. U da̱na̱ ta̱ no ogbolo a anga a̱ rumu. U tsu tama ta̱ reve wu ɓoso, a̱vu ili i na i buwai wu dasa na ana a̱ yi. U tawa ta̱ ko'o na akapi e inama a na a buwai aza a na a̱ ta̱wa̱i elime a̱ yi suru, waru u da̱na̱ ta̱ na avana kupa.<verse eid="DAN 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 7:8" />&lt;&lt;A̱mu a yuwusan majiyan ma avana o ndolo, a̱vu me ene aavana o ro za ke'en, za na uta̱i a̱tsuma̱ e le, reve a̱ mula̱ aza a ta'atsu o ufaru. Aavana a nda a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ ne esu tse esu a vaɗilima̱ nu una̱ a yuwusan adanshi nu uvaɗu.<verse eid="DAN 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 7:9" />&lt;&lt;A̱mu a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱ka̱nla̱, a̱vu a zuwa otogu o tsugono, a̱vu Za na Ri Lo Kuci da̱nu, itana ya̱ yi i da̱na̱ ta̱ u'uri puwu tsa̱ tsikilu. A̱nji a̱ yi waru uri tsa̱ a̱punda̱ a̱ uri. Ootogu o tsugono tsa̱ yi waru a madala tse elentsu a akina, a̱ga̱nda̱mu a̱yi waru a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ a madala na akina.<verse eid="DAN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 7:10" />&lt;&lt;Uɗolu wa akina u da̱na̱ ta̱ e meyene, o uta̱sa̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ yi. Ukpakukupa ukpakukupa a̱bunda̱ a̱ ta̱wusa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ yi a yuwusaan yi a̱ga̱nda̱, ukpakukupa kupa toto ukpakukupa kupa e isawan a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ yi, a̱vu a̱za̱ o uge'etosu a̱ da̱nu adama o uge'etosu, reve a̱ kpa̱tu'wa̱ atagada.<verse eid="DAN 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 7:11" />&lt;&lt;A̱vu n lyuwa elime na̱ a̱ka̱nla̱ adama e idanshi yu uvaɗu i na aavana'a waa yuwusan. A̱vu n lyuwa elime na̱ a̱ka̱nla̱ she mantsa ma na a paɗai nama'a a̱vu a̱ lungusa̱ lipu va̱ yi waru a vari yi a̱tsuma̱ a akina tsa̱ra̱ u kula̱. <verse eid="DAN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 7:12" />(Ele akapi e inama'a a usa ta̱ ucira u le, amma a lyawa le ta̱ wuma hali mantsa wa'a.)<verse eid="DAN 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 7:13" />&lt;&lt;A̱tsuma̱ a alavu alavu a̱ va̱ na ayin n ka̱lyuwa̱ ta̱, a̱vu me ene nanza elime a̱ va̱ tsa mawun ma vuma, a̱ ta̱wa̱ a̱tsuma̱ e eleshe a̱vu u ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wu Za na Ri Lo Kuci a̱vu a tara yi a̱ tyo a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ yi. <verse eid="DAN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 7:14" />A̱vu a ca yi ucira na̱ tsugbain oɓolo na̱ tsugono, adama ama suru na̱ nɗa ne elentsu a yuwaan yi a̱ga̱nda̱. Tsugono tsa̱ yi tsa̱ ri nu utyo shi, tsugono tsa na tsa̱a̱ ka̱ra̱ tsa ɗa shi, waru babu za na aa gura kototo tsugono tsa̱ yi.<verse eid="DAN 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ucuɗuwu wa alavu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 7:15" />&lt;&lt;A̱mu Daniya, u ɓa̱la̱ mu ta̱ o okolo a̱ va̱, alavu alavu a na me enei wu da'waton mu ta̱ a̱bunda̱ lon. <verse eid="DAN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 7:16" />A̱vu n ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wu za ta̱ wa aza a na a̱ da̱na̱i mishin lo ɗaɗa me ece niyi amayun e ili i nda suru. Reve u damma mu waru u cuɗuwa mu ili'i. <verse eid="DAN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 7:17" />&lt;Inama i gbagbain i na̱shi i nda ele ɗa ngono n na̱shi aza a na a̱a̱ 'yon a̱tsuma̱ o uvaɗi. <verse eid="DAN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 7:18" />Agba ama a akiza o Mogono ma̱ A̱sula̱, a̱ ta̱ ushi tsugono a̱vu waru tsugono'o wo o'wo za le babu ukotu.&gt;<verse eid="DAN 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 7:19" />&lt;&lt;A̱vu n shi n ciga n tsura̱ amayun o urevu wu nama na̱shi, za na tawai ko'o na akapi waru ili i wovon i ɗa lon, na anga a̱ rumu na̱ a̱kpa̱ta̱ a̱ rumushili, nama na shi minjirai reve waru u tama aza a na a̱ riya̱i a̱vu waru wu dasa ili i na i buwai na ana a̱ yi. <verse eid="DAN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 7:20" />Waru n shi ta̱ n ciga n reve adama a avana kupa a na a̱ ri a aaci a̱ yi waru na adama a aavana a na o uta̱i, za na mula̱i avana a̱ ta'atsu elime a̱ yi. N shi ta̱ n ciga n tsura̱ urevu wa aavana a na a̱ ri ne esu nu una̱ u na u ri a adanshi a̱ba̱jini a adanshi o uvaɗu, za na a̱ yindi i va̱ u la'a ta̱ akapi mgbain. <verse eid="DAN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 7:21" />A̱mu a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱ka̱nla̱, a̱yi aavana a nda a yuwusan ta̱ uvon na ama a akiza a̱vu u lyuwa aci e le, <verse eid="DAN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 7:22" />she na Za na Ri Lo Kuci ta̱wa̱i, a̱vu u yuwan adanshi o uge'etosu u mejege adama a ama akiza o Mogono ma̱ A̱sula̱. A̱vu mantsa ma yuwan a na ama a akiza'a a̱ ta̱wa̱ a̱ ushiyi tsugono'o.<verse eid="DAN 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 7:23" />&lt;&lt;Apa ucuɗuwu u na u ca numu: &lt;A̱yi nama na̱shi a̱yi ɗa tsugono tsa̱ na̱shi za na a̱a̱ ta̱wa̱ a̱tsuma̱ o uvaɗi. U ta tawa ko'o na akapi o tsugono suru waru u ta lyuwa uvaɗi ma̱ɓula̱, u ta dasasa yi na ana waru u to ɓoso yi. <verse eid="DAN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 7:24" />Ele avana kupa ele ɗa ngono kupa n na mo uta̱ pa a̱tsuma̱ o tsugono tsa nda. A̱ca̱pa̱ e le mogono mo ro ma̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱, ko'o na aza a na a̱ ta̱wa̱i ɗe, u ta lyuwa aci o ngono n ta'atsu. <verse eid="DAN 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 7:25" />U ta yuwan adanshi a avama e ekere o Mogono ma̱ A̱sula̱, reve u ɓongi ama a akiza o Mogono ma̱ A̱sula̱, u ta ciga a vadala mantsa nu uritosu u wila̱. A ta ca ama a akiza e ekere a̱ yi a mantsa wa'a, mantsa na akapi a mantsa.<verse eid="DAN 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 7:26" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Amma ukobu wu uge'etosu u ta̱ da̱nu, a̱vu a usa ucira wa̱ yi a̱vu o kototo yi suru suru. <verse eid="DAN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 7:27" />Waru a ta ca ama a akiza o Mogono ma̱ A̱sula̱, tsugono nu ucira na̱ tsugbain u tsugono u na u ri za̱la̱ va zuva suru. Tsugono tsa̱ yi tso to o'wo babu ukotu, waru ngono mu uvaɗi suru n ta yuwaan yi a̱ga̱nda̱ na̱ tsutoni.&gt;<verse eid="DAN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 7:28" />&lt;&lt;A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗaɗa ukosu wa adanshi'i. A̱mu Daniya, n da̱na̱ ta̱ wuda'un lon a majiyan ma̱ va̱, a̱vu urewesu u va̱ u lukuta̱, a̱vu n zuwa ili i nda o okolo a̱ va̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DAN 8" />
  <para style="s">Alavu alavu a Daniya a̱ a̱a̱giri'i na̱ megbele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 8:1" />A aa'wan a ta'atsu o tsugono tsa Belshaza alavu alavu a̱ ta̱wa̱ mu ta̱ a̱mu Daniya, babu na̱ za na me enei nu ufaru. <verse eid="DAN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 8:2" />A̱tsuma̱ a alavu alavu a̱ va̱ me ene ta̱ aciya̱va̱ o ukari wa Susa upasu wa Elam, a alavu alavu'u n da̱na̱ ta̱ o Uɗolu wa Ulai. <verse eid="DAN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 8:3" />A̱vu n 'ya̱sa̱n esu a̱ va̱ zuva a̱vu me ene a̱a̱giri'i mishin a̱ mɓa̱nga̱ mu uɗolu'u. U da̱na̱ ta̱ na avana e re, avana'a ra a̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ uga'an, amma za ta̱ la'a ta̱ za ta̱. Agba za na la'ai uga'an a̱yi ɗa u koso uta̱i. <verse eid="DAN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 8:4" />Me ene ta̱ a̱a̱giri'i a̱ za̱ɓa̱luwusa̱ a̱ tyo a̱livu nu ugana nu uyagi. Babu nama na gura isawain nla̱ngi na̱ a̱yi, babu waru vuma na aa gura wawa za ro o ucira wa̱ yi. U yuwan ta̱ cine u cigai a̱vu waru wo o'wo zagbain.<verse eid="DAN 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 8:5" />A̱mu pe a̱tsuma̱ a majiyan me ili i na me enei, a̱vu ma̱ga̱ji mo uta̱ ɗe a̱livu, a̱vu u paɗalulai uvaɗi ma̱ɓula̱ agba u ju'wa̱in iɗa shi ko ke'en. A̱yi ma̱ga̱ji'i u ta̱ na azangaga a aavana e memere me esu a̱ yi. <verse eid="DAN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 8:6" />U ta̱wa̱ ta̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ a̱a̱giri'i a na a̱ ri na avana e re'e, za na me enei mishin o uɗolu'u, a̱vu u zura̱ yi nu upan lon. <verse eid="DAN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 8:7" />A̱vu waru me ene yi u zura̱ a̱a̱ga̱ri'i'i nu upan lon. A̱vu u gama yi hali wu kuɗa avana e re a na u ri na̱ a̱yi. Agba a̱a̱giri'i'i u ri nu ucira u na waa gura yuwan nla̱ngi na̱ a̱yi shi. A̱vu ma̱ga̱ji ma vari yi e iɗa hali wu dasa yi. Babu za na gura wawai a̱a̱giri'i'i e ekere a̱ ma̱ga̱ji'i. <verse eid="DAN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 8:8" />A̱vu ma̱ga̱ji'i u yuwan ucira a̱bunda̱ lon, amma ana u da̱na̱i nu ucira a̱bunda̱ lon, a̱vu aavana a na a̱ da̱na̱i nu ucira'a u kuɗa, o una̱ wa yi a̱vu avana a̱ na̱shi o uta̱ a̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ pepu vu pasu na̱shi va zuva, ele ɗa asana na̱ a̱livu nu ugana oɓolo nu uyagi.<verse eid="DAN 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 8:9" />A̱tsuma̱ a za ta̱ le a̱vu mavana mo ro mo uta̱, reve u yuwan ucira lon hali u rawa uyagi na asana ni Iɗa i Sa'ani. <verse eid="DAN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 8:10" />U yuwan ta̱ mgbain hali u rawa oɓolo e ili i na a yuwain zuva. A̱vu u vari oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva o ro ni italyo'o i ro a̱ tyo e iɗa a̱vu wu dasa le. <verse eid="DAN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 8:11" />U ka̱mba̱to ta̱ aciya̱yi na̱ tsugbain cine vu revei Yali yo oɓolo ya̱ a̱soja a zuva. Reve a putsa na̱ kucci na a tsu yuwusaan yi kuci, a̱vu a̱ lungusa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa akiza wa̱ yi. <verse eid="DAN 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 8:12" />Adama e iwuya ya̱ a̱bunda̱, a̱vu a ca yi oɓolo aza a akiza na̱ kucci na a casu usana suru. U lyuwa ta̱ elime a̱tsuma̱ e ili i na u yuwain suru, a̱vu a vari amayun e iɗa.<verse eid="DAN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 8:13" />A̱vu mu uwwa za va akiza ta̱ aa yuwusan adanshi, a̱vu waru za va akiza ta̱ damma za na yuwain adanshi'i, &lt;&lt;Ujumu u ne waa jima kafu alavu alavu'u u shiwan, a̱yi alavu alavu a̱ kucci vu usana suru nu unusu u na u tsu ta̱wa̱ nu ulungusu nu ucasu wa̱ a̱a̱'isa̱, reve waru a dasa oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva za̱la̱ va ana?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 8:14" />Reve u damma mu, &lt;&lt;U ta tara ayin nu usana ukpakukupa ure nu ukpakuta'atsu (2,300), a̱vu a suwisa a̱a̱'isa̱'a̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ucuɗuwu wa alavu alavu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 8:15" />Ana a̱mu Daniya me enei alavu alavu'u, n zami ta̱ ure u na ma̱a̱ tsura̱ urevu wa̱ yi. A̱vu me ene za ro mishin elime a̱ va̱ oroci a vuma. <verse eid="DAN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 8:16" />A̱vu mu uwwa uɗyo u vuma ro ɗe o Uɗolu wa Ulai e ɗesu, &lt;&lt;Jibura'ilu, cuɗuwa vuma nda urevu wa alavu alavu'u.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 8:17" />A̱vu u ta̱wa̱ zuzu nu uba̱ta̱ u na n ri mishin. Ana u ta̱wa̱i, mu uwwa ta̱ wovon a̱vu n riya̱ ma̱kpa̱ɓa̱. Agba a̱vu u damma mu, &lt;&lt;Mawun ma vaɗilima̱, vu reve a na alavu alavu a nda adama a mantsa mo ukosu ma ɗa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 8:18" />A̱yi a adanshi na̱ a̱mu, a̱vu n lantsa kwin nu urewesu u va̱ ma̱kpa̱ɓa̱. A̱vu u ju'wa̱n mu a̱vu u 'ya̱sa̱n mu mishin.<verse eid="DAN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 8:19" />Reve u damma mu, &lt;&lt;N ta damma wu ili i na yaa fara a mantsa ma na ma̱a̱ ta̱wa̱ a mantsa ma na A̱sula̱ oo roco upan wa̱ yi. Adama a na alavu alavu'u u ta yuwusan adanshi a mantsa ma na a zuwai mo ukosu. <verse eid="DAN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 8:20" />Adama a̱ a̱a̱giri'i a na ve enei na avana e re, u ta̱ a̱ nden mu ngono ma Pashiya na̱ Midiya. <verse eid="DAN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 8:21" />A̱yi waru ma̱ga̱ji mo ndolo u ta̱ a̱ nden m mogono ma Heleni. A̱yi a̱ba̱jini a aavana o ndolo gba a na a̱ ri e memere me esu, u ta̱ a̱ nden m mogono mo ufaru. <verse eid="DAN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 8:22" />Avana a̱ na̱shi gba aza a na o uta̱i o una̱ wu za na a kuɗai a̱ ta̱ u ta̱ a̱ nden n tsugono n na̱shi tsa na tsa̱a̱ 'yon e iɗa ya̱ yi, agba a̱ da̱na̱ na̱ cu'un vu ucira va̱ yi shi.<verse eid="DAN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 8:23" />&lt;&lt;O ukosu u tsugono tse le, mantsa ma na makundatsu me iwuya me le ma shiwain, mogono ma wuya mo ro ma̱ ta̱ 'yon, za va wa aciyogbamu, mogono ma̱ wulumusa̱. <verse eid="DAN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 8:24" />U ta̱ da̱na̱ nu ucira lon, amma nu ucira wa̱ yi u ɗa shi. U ta̱ ta̱wa̱ nu ulungusu u wovon wa̱ a̱bunda̱ lon, e ili i na waa yuwusan suru waru u ta lyuwa aci. U to kototo ama a gbagbain oɓolo na ama a akiza. <verse eid="DAN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 8:25" />A̱tsuma̱ o ugbozu u vama wa̱ yi u ta zuwa wulumusa̱ u yuwan a̱bunda̱. A̱tsuma̱ o okolo a̱ yi, u ta tara aciya̱yi zagbain. Babu urevu ɗaɗa woo kototo ama na̱ a̱bunda̱. Waru u ta zami Zagbain va azagbain nla̱ngi, amma gba a ta kukuɗa yi agba nu ucira u vuma u ɗa shi.<verse eid="DAN 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 8:26" />&lt;&lt;Alavu alavu a ayin nu usana a na a dammai amayun a ɗa, amma gba vu lyawa yi usokowu, adama a na u ta yuwusan adanshi a rana va̱ a̱bunda̱ ve elime.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 8:27" />A̱mu Daniya, n ta̱ka̱luwa̱ ta̱ reve m banakan rana meketeci. A̱vu n 'yon n reme ulinga u mogono. A̱mu gba alavu alavu o ndolo a zuwa mu ta̱ mo o'wo wuda'un, waru n tsura̱ urevu wa̱ yi shi.<verse eid="DAN 8:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DAN 9" />
  <para style="s">Avasa a Daniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 9:1" />A̱tsuma̱ a aa'wan o ufaru a Dariyu ulobo wa Ahasuweru, (za va Midiya), za na a zuwai mogono ma Babila, <verse eid="DAN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 9:2" />a aa'wan o ufaru o tsugono tsa̱ yi, a̱mu Daniya, n tsura̱ ta̱ urevu a̱tsuma̱ a adanshi a̱ A̱sula̱, a adanshi a̱ A̱sulazuva a na a cayi Irimiya vumava̱sula̱, a na Urishelima ta̱ da̱na̱ lo ulungusu hali a'wan kupocindere. <verse eid="DAN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 9:3" />A̱vu n vadala urewesu u va̱ a̱ tyo e ekere a̱ Mogono ma̱ A̱sulazuva, a patishi yi na avasa oɓolo na̱ matara ma akuli wotowu na akashi no okomo adama a̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu.<verse eid="DAN 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 9:4" />A̱vu m pati A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ va̱ a̱vu n damma unusu u tsu, adansa, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva, Mogono ma Gbain, za na tsu ca wovon, za na waru tsu gura shiton nzuwulai, za na tsu vadala icigi ya̱ yi shi a̱ tyo e ekere aza a na a̱ ri e icigi ya̱ yi waru a̱ kurusu wila̱ wa̱ yi. <verse eid="DAN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 9:5" />Tsu yuwan ta̱ unusu waru tsu ka̱la̱ma̱ ta̱, a̱vu tsu yuwan linga wuya a̱vu waru tsu 'ya̱sa̱a̱n wu aci. Waru tsu lyawa ta̱ itoni ili i na vu zuwai na̱ wila̱ wa̱ wu. <verse eid="DAN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 9:6" />Tsu zuwaa ama̱sula̱ a̱ wu atsuvu shi, aza a na a yuwusain adanshi o una̱ wa̱ wu uba̱ta̱ wu ngono n tsu, na azagbain oɓolo na̱ nkaya n tsu, na ama e iɗa'a suru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 9:7" />&lt;&lt;Mogono ma Gbain, a̱vu za va̱ a̱ɓula̱ ɗa, a̱tsu gba tso o'wo ta̱ ili i wono. Wono u nda u toni tsu ta̱ suru ana'an, ama a Yahuda na ama a Urishelima na aza a Isra'ila suru, aza a na a̱ ri alanga na aza a na a̱ ri zuzu, a nɗa n na vu bete'we nle suru adama o ulambu wa̱ a̱ɓula̱ u na a yuwaan nuwu. <verse eid="DAN 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 9:8" />A̱sulazuva, a̱tsu na̱ ngono n tsu, na azagbain a̱ tsu oɓolo na̱ nkaya n tsu tso o'wo ta̱ ili i wono adama a na tsu yuwain unusu a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ wu. <verse eid="DAN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 9:9" />Amma Mogono ma gbain ma̱ tsu, u ta̱ ni isa'ani na̱ mayan ma gafura, ko na tsu 'ya̱sa̱a̱n niyi aci. <verse eid="DAN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 9:10" />Tsu toni adanshi a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu shi, waru tsu toni wila̱ u na vu ca ntsu e ekere a agbashi a̱ wu ama̱sula̱ shi. <verse eid="DAN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 9:11" />Ama a Isra'ila suru a yuwan ta̱ unusu, a lyawa ta̱ ure wa̱ wu, a̱vu a̱ kuɗa̱ a zuwaa wu atsuvu. Adama o ndolo nu uge'etosu u na a kucinai aza a na a̱ ri uɗanu a̱tsuma̱ a̱ wila̱ wa Musa aagbashi a̱ A̱sula̱, a̱ tsuwa̱n tsu ele ta̱, adama a na tsu yuwaan nuwu unusu. <verse eid="DAN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 9:12" />Vu shiton ta̱ adanshi a̱ wu, za na vu yuwain a aci a̱ tsu na aci a azagbain a na a yuwusan tsugbain a aci a̱ tsu na vu ta̱wa̱a̱ ntsu na̱ a̱ba̱jini a̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱. Amayun za̱la̱ va zuva suru koto a yuwan cu'un vi ili i na a yuwain a̱tsuma̱ a Urishelima shi. <verse eid="DAN 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 9:13" />Cine u ri uɗanu a̱ Wila̱ wa Musa, tsundolo tsa ɗa a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a̱ ta̱wa̱ ntsu, agba na̱ ne suru tsu zami isa'ani ya̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu shi, tsu lyawa mayuwan me iwuya shi, waru tsu kuru amayun a̱ wu shi. <verse eid="DAN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 9:14" />A̱sulazuva gba a̱ kuɗa̱ a ca tsu a̱tsuma̱lima̱ shi, adama a na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu za va̱ a̱ɓula̱ ɗa a̱tsuma̱ e ili i na waa yuwusan, na̱ ne suru tsu toni yi shi. <verse eid="DAN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 9:15" />Gogo, Mogono ma Gbain A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu, a̱vu na vu uta̱yi ama a̱ wu e iɗa ya Masar nu ukere wu ucira waru a̱vu na vu yuwayin aciya̱wu ala a na a̱ ri a̱ tyo ana'an, tsu yuwan ta unusu, a̱vu tsu yuwan ili i na i ri ulobonu shi. <verse eid="DAN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 9:16" />Mogono ma Gbain, adama e ili ya̱ a̱ɓula̱ i na vu tsu yuwan suru, vu bula̱ upan wu usuɗuwu wa̱ wu na vu yuwain na̱ lyuci va̱ wu Urishelima, aagaɗi a̱ wu a akiza. Adama o unusu u tsu ni iwuya yi nkaya n tsu, Urishelima na ama a̱ wu o o'wo ta̱ ili yu ulamu e ekere aza a na a̱ ri uka̱nda̱ruwu na̱ a̱tsu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="DAN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 9:17" />&lt;&lt;Gogo A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu, uwwa avasa ni ipati yi izami yi isa'ani ya aagbashi a wu. Mogono ma Gbain adama a̱ wu, ve ene iliyali yo ofoli ya̱ a̱a̱'isa̱ a̱ wu. <verse eid="DAN 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 9:18" />A̱sula̱ a̱ va̱ vu polo atsuvu vu uwwa, vu kpa̱tu'wa̱ esu a̱ wu ve ene cine lyuci gbain na̱ a̱tsu na ee ɗesu na ala a̱ wu tso o'woi ili ye pere. Tsu ta̱wa̱ ni ipati i tsu shi adama a na tsu te eneshe ngashi tsu ta̱ na̱ a̱ɓula̱, agba adama e isa'ani ya̱ a̱bunda̱ ya̱ wu i ɗa. <verse eid="DAN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 9:19" />Mogono ma Gbain vu uwwa tsu, vu yuwaan tsu gafura. Vu poloo tsu atsuvu. A̱sula̱ a̱ va̱, she vu lungusa̱ mantsa wan, adama a na na ala a̱ wu a ɗa ee ɗesu lyuci nda na ama a̱ wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupocindere ba̱ta̱ cindere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 9:20" />A̱mu a̱tsuma̱ a adanshi na avasa, a vadalasa a̱ nusu va̱ na̱ nusu va ama a̱ va̱ aza a Isra'ila waru a̱ ta̱wusa̱ ni ipati i va̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ va̱ adama a aagaɗi a akiza a̱ yi, <verse eid="DAN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 9:21" />a̱mu pe ubuwu a adanshi a̱tsuma̱ a avasa, a̱vu Jibura'ilu za na n shi me enei ɗe a̱tsuma̱ alavu alavu o ufaru, u cipushi uba̱ta̱ u va̱ a mantsa ma na a tsu ca kucci vu ulivu. <verse eid="DAN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 9:22" />U revetyo mu ta̱ u damma, &lt;&lt;Daniya, n ta̱wa̱ ta̱ n ca wu ucuɗuwu nu urevu. <verse eid="DAN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 9:23" />A mantsa ma na vu temei avasa, a yuwan ta̱ adanshi. N ta̱wa̱ ta̱ n ka̱mbuwa̱ wu, adama a na a tara wu ta̱ ili ya̱ a̱ɓula̱ lon. Adama o ndolo ka̱lyuwa̱ ikaka'a a̱vu vu tsura̱ urevu wa alavu alavu'u.<verse eid="DAN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 9:24" />&lt;&lt;A zuwa ta̱ ajuma kupocindere adama a ama a̱ wu na̱ lyuci va akiza va̱ wu a zuwa a̱tyo o unusu u na a yuwusan, a zuwa ukosu u mayan mo unusu, adama a tara ume wu unusu, reve a̱ ta̱wa̱ na̱ a̱ɓula̱ a na a̱ ri n koto shi, adama a zuwaa alavu alavu'u nu udammu wu usokowu ukere, adama waru a̱ tsun uba̱ta̱ u na la'ai akiza mani'in.<verse eid="DAN 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 9:25" />&lt;&lt;Vu reve waru vu tsura̱ urevu a na diga a mantsa ma na a zuwai a suwisa Urishelima hali a̱ tyo mantsa ma na zagbain a̱a̱ ta̱wa̱ za na a̱ tsuyin mani'in, a ta yuwan ajuma e cindere. A ta tara ajuma kupota̱li ne ejere a suwusa yi, a̱vu a yuwan re, na̱ a̱a̱ba̱jini a̱ a̱a̱ka̱ri e ipiri a̱ ka̱nda̱ruwa̱, agba u to o'wo a mantsa ma̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱. <verse eid="DAN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 9:26" />No o koto ajuma kupota̱li ne ejere, o to koɗo za na a̱ tsuyin mani'in waru waa buwa ni ili shi. A̱soja a zagbain o ndolo na̱ a̱ ta̱wa̱ o to kototo lyuci nu uba̱ta̱ wa akiza. Ukosu u lyuci'i u to o'wo tsa̱ a̱ba̱jini a̱ mini. A ta lyuwa elime nu uvon hali a̱ tyo o ukosu, waru a zuwa ta̱ a ta yuwan ukototosu. <verse eid="DAN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 9:27" />A̱yi zagbain ndolo ta yuwan nzuwulai mu ucira na ama a̱ a̱bunda̱ a mantsa ma ajuma a̱ ta̱. Amma a akapi a mantsa'a, u ta putsa na̱ mayan ma̱ kucci na̱ kucci vu ucasu. A ta yuwan ili yi idaba zuva va̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa i na ya̱a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ mona. U ta̱ da̱na̱ lo hali mantsa ma na a̱a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ nu ukosu wu za na a̱ ta̱wusa̱ nu ukototosu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na̱ Tsuyahuda urevu wa̱ yi wu uta̱ a alanga eteshe shi. </char></note>&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DAN 10" />
  <para style="s">Alavu alavu a Daniya a vuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 10:1" />A aa'wan a ta'atsu o tsugono tsa Sayiru mogono ma Pashiya, o roco ta̱ Daniya za na a̱ tsu ɗe Belteshaza alavu alavu. Ikaka ya̱ yi amayun a ɗa waru u ta̱ aɗa a̱ a̱ba̱jini o uvon. Ucuɗuwu wi ikaka'a u ta̱wa̱ yi ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ alavu alavu.<verse eid="DAN 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 10:2" />A mantsa mo ndolo a̱mu Daniya, n yuwan ta̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu ajuma a ta'atsu. <verse eid="DAN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 10:3" />A̱tsuma̱ a ajuma a ta'atsu o ndolo n lyuwa ilyalya yu uyo'o shi, ko nama n tama shi ko n sowo masayan ma̱ ina̱bi waru n sukuma mani'in shi ko ke'en.<verse eid="DAN 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 10:4" />O urana wu ushin na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ na̱shi o woto wu ufaru, n da̱na̱ ta̱ mishin a̱ nge'en mu Uɗolu wa̱ Tigiris, <verse eid="DAN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 10:5" />a̱vu n 'ya̱sa̱n aci zuva ɗaɗa me enei vuma wotowu ni itana yo okoro, na̱ gbakala na a yuwain na̱ zinariya can e ikyun ya̱ yi. <verse eid="DAN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 10:6" />Lipu va̱ yi da̱na̱ ta̱ ne ekan cine vu revei aatali e ikebe a kirisola, urewesu wa̱ yi waru cine vu revei imaɗatsu, esu a̱ yi waru cine vu revei elentsu a akina, ekere na ana a̱ yi a ta a madala tsu rumushili na o gboroi, mesun mo uɗyo ma̱ yi cine vu revei uɗyo wa̱ a̱ba̱jini o oɓolo a ama.<verse eid="DAN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 10:7" />A̱mu Daniya, a̱mu ɗa goon me enei alavu alavu'u, ama a na a̱ da̱na̱i oɓolo na̱ a̱mu gba e ene alavu alavu'u shi, amma wovon wa̱ a̱bunda̱ u reme le ta̱ hali a suma, a̱vu a pa'an. <verse eid="DAN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 10:8" />Ɗaɗa a lyawa numu a̱ nde'en ɗaɗa gba me enei a̱ba̱jini a alavu alavu'u, reve waru mo o'wo babu ucira. Urewesu u va̱ waru u vadala ta̱ a̱bunda̱ lon, lipu va̱ waru kuwa̱ ta̱. <verse eid="DAN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 10:9" />A̱vu mu uwwa yi a adanshi a̱vu n zuwaa yi atsuvu, ɗaɗa n lantsai kwin, nu urewesu u va̱ ma̱kpa̱ɓa̱.<verse eid="DAN 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 10:10" />A̱vu ukere u ju'wa̱in mu a̱vu u zuwa mu n kingyo e ekere a̱ va̱ na̱ a̱ a̱lu a̱ va̱ e meje'en. <verse eid="DAN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 10:11" />A̱vu u damma mu, &lt;&lt;A̱vu Daniya, ili yi icigi ya̱ a̱bunda̱ a ɗa e ekere a̱ A̱sula̱, vu zuwa atsuvu e ili i na maa damma wu. Vu 'yon mishin, adama a na uba̱ta̱ wa̱ wu u ɗa a̱ lyungu numu.&gt;&gt; A̱yi a̱tsuma̱ a adanshi tsundolo, a̱vu n 'yon mishin, a̱vu n uwa meje'en.<verse eid="DAN 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 10:12" />Reve u damma mu, &lt;&lt;Daniya, she vu uwwa wovon wan. Diga o urana wu ufaru u na vu zuwai okolo a̱ wu vu zami urevu, a̱vu vu ka̱ɗa̱to aciya̱wu a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ wu a uwwa ta̱ ipati ya̱ wu, ɗaɗa n ta̱wa̱yi. <verse eid="DAN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 10:13" />Amma mogono mo tsugono ma Pashiya ma̱ piri ta̱ nla̱ngi na̱ a̱mu hali rana ushin na̱ za ta̱. Amma malingata ma̱ A̱sula̱ Mika'ilu za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a azagbain, u ta̱wa̱ ta̱ u kamba mu, adama a na a̱ guza̱ mu ta̱ lo uba̱ta̱ u mogono ma Pashiya. <verse eid="DAN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 10:14" />Gogo n ta̱wa̱ ta̱ n cuɗuwa wu ili i na yaa cina ama a̱ wu nda elime, adama a na alavu alavu'u u ta yuwusan aɗa a mantsa me elime.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 10:15" />A̱yi a dansaa mu idanshi i nda, a̱vu n ka̱ɗa̱to urewesu u va̱ e iɗa, a̱vu mo o'wo kpen, n yuwan adanshi shi. <verse eid="DAN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 10:16" />A̱vu nanza oroci a vuma ju'wa̱n una̱ u va̱, ɗaɗa m kpa̱tu'wa̱i una̱ u va̱ a̱vu n fara adanshi. A̱vu n damma za na ri mishin zuzu na̱ a̱mu, &lt;&lt;U ɓa̱la̱ mu ta̱ adama a alavu alavu a nda, zagbain va̱, waru m buwa nu ucira shi. <verse eid="DAN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 10:17" />Cine tsa ɗa a̱mu aagbashi a̱ wu a yuwan adanshi na̱ a̱vu zagbain va̱? Gogo tsunda m buwa nu ucira shi, waru m buwa na̱ wivuwun gben shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 10:18" />A̱vu waru za na rotsoi vuma'a u ju'wisa̱n mu a̱vu u ca mu ucira. <verse eid="DAN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 10:19" />A̱vu u damma mu, &lt;&lt;A̱vu na vu tsura̱i icigi ya̱ a̱bunda̱ e ekere a̱ A̱sula̱, she vu uwwa wovon wan, lyawa asuvu a̱ wu a̱ da̱nu, vu da̱na̱ nu ucira no okolo ugbamu.&gt;&gt; A̱yi a yuwusan adanshi na̱ a̱mu, a̱vu n tsura̱ ucira a̱vu n damma, &lt;&lt;Zagbain va̱ yuwan adanshi, adama a na vu ca numu ucira.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 10:20" />A̱vu u damma, &lt;&lt;Vu reve ta̱ ili i na i zuwai n ta̱wa̱i ya̱'a̱ wu? Gogo nda n ta̱ ka̱mba̱ n yuwan uvon na̱ mogono ma Pashiya, na̱ n ka̱ra̱ mogono ma̱ Heleni ma̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱. <verse eid="DAN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 10:21" />Agba n ta damma wu ili i na i ri uɗanu a̱tsuma̱ a Aatagada a Amayun. Babu za na kamba numu uvon na̱ nan ruhu o ndolo she Mika'ilu, zagbain va̱ wu.<verse eid="DAN 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DAN 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 11:1" />&lt;&lt;A̱tsuma̱ a aa'wan o ufaru wa Dariyu za va Midiya, a̱vu m piri adama n kamba waru n geshe yi.<verse eid="DAN 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mogono mo Uyagi na̱ mogono mo Ugana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 11:2" />&lt;&lt;Gogo tsunda, n ta damma wu amayun. A̱ ta̱ da̱shi yuwan ngono n ta'atsu a̱tsuma̱ a Pashiya, za va̱ na̱shi le ta la'a suru nle utsuru a̱bunda̱ lon. Nu u usa ucira nu utsuru wa̱ yi, u ta zuwa vuma suru yuwan uvon na̱ tsugono tsa Heleni. <verse eid="DAN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 11:3" />A̱vu wo o'wo mogono ma gbain ma̱a̱ 'yon, za na aa yuwan tsugono nu ucira lon, a̱vu waru u yuwan cine u cigai. <verse eid="DAN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 11:4" />Amma na̱ tsugono tsa̱ yi tsa yuwan ucira, tsugono'o u te ne'eshen, waru e te ne'eshen yi ba̱ta̱ na̱shi, a̱ tyo pasu na̱shi va zuva. Tsugono'o wee tyo o ugundo wa̱ yi shi, waru aa yuwan tsugono nu ucira cine a̱yi u yuwain shi, adama a na a ta usa tsugono tsa̱ yi a̱vu a ca ozo o ro.<verse eid="DAN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 11:5" />&lt;&lt;Mogono mo Uyagi ma̱ ta̱ da̱na̱ nu ucira, amma vuma ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a nan yali va̱ yi, u ta̱ tsura̱ ucira u la'a yi, waru tsugono tsa̱ yi tsa̱ ta̱ da̱na̱ ucira lon. <verse eid="DAN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 11:6" />Na a yuwan a'wan a̱bunda̱ a̱ ta̱ da̱na̱ a̱ nsa̱la̱la̱i. Usheli u mogono mo Uyagi ma̱ ta̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ u mogono mo Ugana a yuwan nsa̱la̱la̱i, agba wa̱a̱ da̱na̱ nu ucira wa̱ yi shi, a̱yi waru na̱ tsugono tsa̱ yi, tsa jima shi. A rana ndolo u ta̱ uwa e ekere a za ro, ne esheli o ushewusun a̱ yi oɓolo na aabara a̱ yi na aza a na a̱ guza̱a̱ niyi ikyun.<verse eid="DAN 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 11:7" />&lt;&lt;Vuma ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ o ugundo wa̱ yi u ta̱ 'yon a̱vu u ushi uba̱ta̱ wa̱ yi. U ta yuwan uvon na̱ a̱soja o mogono mo Ugana a̱vu u uwa o ukari wa̱ yi, u ta yuwan uvon ne ele a̱vu gba u lyuwa aci. <verse eid="DAN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 11:8" />Babu na̱ a̱yi ndolo, u ta usa musula̱ n le oɓolo na̱ she'en na a yuwain, u 'ya̱wa̱ ne ele Masar. Waru u ta̱ pura̱ itana i na a yuwain na̱ azurufa na̱ zinariya a na a̱ ri ni ikebe. A ta yuwan a'wan na̱ a̱bunda̱ a̱a̱ 'ya̱wa̱a̱ mogono mo Ugana nu uvon shi. <verse eid="DAN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 11:9" />Na̱ a̱ca̱pa̱ a̱vu mogono mo Ugana ma uwa e iɗa i mogono mo Uyagi nu uvon, agba u ta̱ ka̱mba̱ e iɗa ya̱ yi. <verse eid="DAN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 11:10" />Muwun ma̱ yi n to foɓo uvon a̱vu u ɓoloto a̱soja a̱ a̱bunda̱, aza a na a̱a̱ 'yon a̱vu a uwulai a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa'a cine vu revei a̱ba̱jini a̱ mini, a̱vu a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ nu uvon hali a rawa o ukari wa̱ yi.<verse eid="DAN 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 11:11" />&lt;&lt;A̱vu mogono mo Uyagi ma̱ 'ya̱wa̱ ma yuwan uvon na̱ mogono mo Ugana nu upan wa̱ a̱bunda̱ za na oo foɓo a̱soja a̱ a̱bunda̱, amma o ukosu a ta lyuwa yi nu uvon. <verse eid="DAN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 11:12" />Na̱ a̱ pura̱ a̱soja'a, a̱yi mogono mo Uyagi ma ta shiwan nu uvaɗu waru u to una ukpakukupa a̱bunda̱, amma na̱ ne suru ulyuwu wa aci wa̱ yi waa jima shi. <verse eid="DAN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 11:13" />Mogono mo Ugana'a u ta̱ 'ya̱sisa̱n a̱ba̱jini o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja u la'a za vu ufaru. Na a yuwan a'wan o ro, u te reme ure na̱ a̱ba̱jini o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja ni itana yu uvon ya̱ a̱bunda̱ lon.<verse eid="DAN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 11:14" />&lt;&lt;A mantsa mo ndolo ama a̱bunda̱ a ta yuwan uvon na̱ mogono mo Uyagi. A̱za̱ o u'ya̱susa̱n wu ugbozu o ro a̱tsuma̱ a ama a̱ wu a̱ ta̱ 'yon na aɗa a na oo shiton alavu alavu'u, agba a̱ ta̱ riya̱. <verse eid="DAN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 11:15" />Amma a̱yi gba mogono mo Ugana ma̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱ a̱vu o ɓoloto ma̱bula̱ a̱vu a kumba e reme lyuci vu ucira'a. A̱soja o Uyagi a gura isawan shi, ko a̱soja a na a gurai uvon aza a na a zagwai, a ta lamba ucira u na ee isawan. <verse eid="DAN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 11:16" />A̱yi gba mogono mo Ugana za na ta̱wa̱a̱ niyi nu uvon u ta yuwan cine u cigai, waru babu za na aa gura isawan elime a̱ yi. U ta lyuwa aci a̱vu wo o'wo ni Iɗa i Sa'ani'i. U ta̱ da̱na̱ nu ucira wu ukototosu. <verse eid="DAN 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 11:17" />U ta ciga u ta̱wa̱ nu ucira u tsugono tsa̱ yi suru a̱vu u yuwan a̱sa̱la̱ na̱ mogono mo Ugana. U ta ca yi usheli u zuwa adama u usa tsugono'o, amma waa lyuwa aci e ifoɓi ya̱ yi shi waru waa kamba yi shi. <verse eid="DAN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 11:18" />Na̱ a̱yi ndolo koto, u ta vadala urewesu wa̱ yi a̱vu u 'ya̱wa̱a̱ upasu wu tyo mala ndeɗe nu uvon, a̱tsuma̱ e le u ta lyuwa le na̱ a̱bunda̱. Amma yali ya̱ a̱soja ro ta̱ ta̱wa̱ u kototo uvaɗu u mogono'o, a̱vu waru u zuwa uvaɗu wa̱ yi u ka̱mba̱ a aciya̱yi. <verse eid="DAN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 11:19" />Reve u vadala a̱vu u ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ u na u ri nu ukari e iɗa ya̱ yi, agba u ta̱ ta̱ɗa̱tsa̱ a̱vu u riya̱, a̱a̱ da̱shi ene yi waru shi.<verse eid="DAN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 11:20" />&lt;&lt;Vuma na a̱a̱ ushi o ukere wa̱ yi u ta̱ lyungu za vu ushishi wu utafa adama tsugbain tso tsugono tsaa lyuwa elime. Agba a jima shi a̱vu o una yi, agba adama o upan wu za ro ɗa shi ko a̱tsuma̱ o uvon shi.<verse eid="DAN 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 11:21" />&lt;&lt;Za na a̱a̱ ushi o ukere wa̱ yi ama aa tara yi ili i ro shi, vuma na ri na agadu o tsugono shi. U ta usa tsugono'o a mantsa ma na ama e enei a̱ ta̱ a̱ nden n lafiya, u ta usa yi ni ikpa'a. <verse eid="DAN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 11:22" />U to kototo a̱soja cine vu revei a̱ba̱jini a̱ mini, reve u foɗo zagbain na a̱ kurusu akucunu a̱ A̱sula̱. <verse eid="DAN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 11:23" />Mantsa ma na a yuwain nsa̱la̱la̱i na̱ mogono'o, u ta̱ ta̱wa̱ u yuwan ugbozu u vama, a̱vu u yuwan ucira na ama wa'a. <verse eid="DAN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 11:24" />Babu urevu a̱vu u ta̱wa̱a̱ pasu vi iɗa na la'ai utsuru uvon, u yuwan ili i na nkaya ma̱ yi n koto n yuwain shi, ko nkaya mu nkaya ma̱ yi. U te ne'eshee aza a na o wo'oso yi ucina̱ itana ya aza a na u pura̱i a mantsa mo uvon. A̱vu waru u yuwan ifoɓi u 'ya̱wa̱a̱ ba̱ta̱ na ri na̱ kari uvon, amma adama a mantsa ma wa'a ma ɗa.<verse eid="DAN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 11:25" />&lt;&lt;U ta̱ tsura̱ ucira wo okolo u na wa̱a̱ 'ya̱wa̱a̱ mogono mo Uyagi nu uvon no oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a̱ a̱bunda̱. Mogono mo Uyagi ma ta yuwan uvon no oɓolo a̱ a̱soja o ucira lon, amma waa gura isawan shi adama e ifoɓi yi ikpa'a na aa yuwaan yi. <verse eid="DAN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 11:26" />Aza a na a lyuwusa ilyalya oɓolo na̱ a̱yi a ta ciga o kototo yi, reve e iza̱ a̱soja a̱ yi, na̱ a̱bunda̱ gba e le a̱ ta̱ kuwa̱. <verse eid="DAN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 11:27" />Ele ngono n re nda a̱ ta̱ da̱na̱ ni ifoɓi i na oo unula̱i, a̱ ta̱ da̱nu uba̱ta̱ u ta̱ a yuwusaan aciyele epen. Amma a̱yi ndolo suru ili i ɗa shi, adama a na ukosu u ta̱ ta̱wa̱ a mantsa ma na a zuwai. <verse eid="DAN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 11:28" />Mogono mo Ugana ma̱ ta̱ ka̱mba̱ e iɗa ya̱ yi nu utsuru wa̱ a̱bunda̱ lon, amma okolo a̱ yi a̱ da̱na̱ ufoɓu u na waa yuwan nla̱ngi na aza a na oo tono akucunu a akiza. U ta yuwan ifoɓi ya̱ yi cine u cigai a̱vu u ka̱mba̱ e iɗa ya̱ yi.<verse eid="DAN 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 11:29" />&lt;&lt;A mantsa ma na A̱sula̱ a zuwai, a̱vu u ka̱mba̱a̱ Uyagi nu uvon, agba a mantsa mo ndolo ili ya̱a̱ da̱na̱ tsu za vu ufaru shi. <verse eid="DAN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 11:30" />Adama a na ama a̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱ na antsun o uvon diga Kitim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kitim ta yuwusan adanshi a̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Roma.</char></note> a̱ 'ya̱sa̱n nla̱ngi na̱ a̱yi, a̱yi gba u ta uwwa wovon a̱vu u bula, a̱vu u ka̱mba̱ nu upan wa̱ a̱bunda̱, a̱vu u puvu upan wa̱ yi a̱ tyo e ekere aza a oo tono akucunu a akiza. U ta̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ ugbozu wa̱ yi uba̱ta̱ wa aza a na a lyawai akucunu a akiza.<verse eid="DAN 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 11:31" />&lt;&lt;A̱soja a̱ yi a̱ ta̱ 'yon a̱vu a̱ lungusa̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa o ucira, a̱vu u zuwa a lyawa kucci vu usana suru. A ta zuwa mayan me ili yi idaba i na ya̱a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ mona. <verse eid="DAN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 11:32" />Aza a na a kuɗai akucunu o ndolo gba, mogono ma̱ ta̱ pura̱ ugbozu u le adama o uyo'o wu una̱ wa̱ yi. Amma aza a na e revei A̱sula̱ e le e te isawan ugbamu a̱vu a̱ piri.<verse eid="DAN 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 11:33" />&lt;&lt;Aza a na a̱ ri nu ugbozu gba a̱ ta̱ kpa̱tu'wa̱ ama na̱ a̱bunda̱ esu, ko na wo o'woi a mantsa wa'a a̱ to una le na̱ matsun me pe'eni ko a̱ kula̱to le ko a̱ pura̱ le a̱ ka̱ra̱ ko a usa itana i le. <verse eid="DAN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 11:34" />Na̱ a̱ riya̱, a̱ ta̱ tsura̱ ikambishi wa'a, reve aza a na a̱ ri na̱ a̱ɓula̱ shi o ɓolo ne ele. <verse eid="DAN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 11:35" />A̱za̱ o ugbozu o ro a̱ ta̱ kuɗa̱, adama a lapula le, a̱ ka̱mba̱to le cece, a̱a̱ da̱na̱ babu abasa, hali ukosu u mantsa, adama a na u ta̱ ta̱wa̱ a mantsa ma na A̱sula̱ a zuwai.<verse eid="DAN 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mogono ma na ma̱ 'ya̱sa̱in aciya̱yi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 11:36" />&lt;&lt;Mogono'o ma ta yuwan cine u cigai. U ta̱ 'ya̱sa̱n aciya̱yi, we ene ngashi u la'a ta̱ ma̱sula̱ suru. U ta yuwan adanshi a avama e ekere a̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ musula̱. U ta lyuwa elime hali mantsa ma na upan wa̱ A̱sula̱ u shiwain, adama a na ili i na A̱sula̱ foɓoi suru u ta shiwan. <verse eid="DAN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 11:37" />Waa tara musula̱ mu nkaya ma̱ yi ili shi, ko musula̱ nna a̱ma̱ci a cigai. Waa tara musula̱ n ro ili shi, adama a na u ta̱ 'ya̱sa̱n aciya̱yi, we ene ngashi u la'a le ta̱ suru. <verse eid="DAN 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DAN 11:38" />O una̱ u ndolo u ta ca musula̱ n na n ri na̱ kari vu ucira tsugbain. U ta ca ma̱sula̱ ma na nkaya ma̱ yi n revei shi tsugbain, o ure u na waa ca yi zinariya oɓolo na̱ azurufa na atali a sa'ani, na̱ ne'en vi ikebe. <verse eid="DAN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DAN 11:39" />U ta usa ba̱ta̱ na ri na̱ kari na la'ai ucira suru suru ni ikambi i ma̱sula̱ me iɗa i ro. Aza a na a̱ usu niyi, u ta ca le tsugbain lon, a̱vu waru u ca le tsugbain tsa ama a̱ a̱bunda̱, a̱vu waru u ne'eshen le iɗa yo o'wo atsupu e le.<verse eid="DAN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DAN 11:40" />&lt;&lt;A̱ tyo o ukosu, mogono mo Uyagi ma̱ ta̱ 'ya̱wa̱a̱ yi nu uvon, a̱vu mogono mo Ugana mo uta̱a̱ yi nu uvon cine vu revei a̱ba̱jini a̱ lipa̱, ni ikeke yi ido na akumbi e ido, na antsun a̱ a̱bunda̱. U ta̱ kuru iɗa iɗa, a̱vu u uwulai pe cine vu revei mini ma̱ tsu ta̱wa̱. <verse eid="DAN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DAN 11:41" />U ta uwa e Iɗa i Sa'ani wu una ama na̱ a̱bunda̱. Amma iɗa ya̱ Edom na̱ za va Mowa, na azagbain e iɗa ya Amon a ta la'a e ekere a̱ yi. <verse eid="DAN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DAN 11:42" />U ta̱ 'ya̱wa̱a̱ nɗa n ro nu uvon, agba iɗa ya Masar ya la'a shi. <verse eid="DAN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DAN 11:43" />U to o'wo zagbain vu utsuru u zinariya na̱ azurufa, ni ili ya̱ a̱ɓula̱ i na i ri pe a̱tsuma̱ a Masar, ama a Libiya waru oɓolo na aza a̱ Kush a̱ ta̱ kuru yi. <verse eid="DAN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DAN 11:44" />Amma ili i na waa uwwa diga asana nu ugana u ta ca yi wovon, a̱vu wu uta̱ nu upan lon u kototo waru wu una ozo o ro na̱ a̱bunda̱. <verse eid="DAN 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DAN 11:45" />U ta̱ shuwa̱ ogodo o tsugono tsa̱ yi e memere ma mala na̱ masasan ma sa'ani ma akiza. Na̱ ne suru u ta̱ kuwa̱, waru babu za na a kamba yi.<verse eid="DAN 11:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DAN 12" />
  <para style="s">Rana vu ukosu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 12:1" />&lt;&lt;A mantsa mo ndolo a̱yi Mika'ilu, zagbain gbain na a̱a̱ pirishi ama a̱ wu, u ta̱ 'yon. A ta yuwan mantsa ma̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ za na koto a yuwain shi ana a yuwain uvaɗi u nda hali a̱ tyo ɗe. Agba a mantsa mo ndolo ama a̱ wu, za na suru a cina a ɗanai aala a̱ yi a̱tsuma̱ a aatagada'a<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aatagada a nda u to gura o'wo aatagada a na a̱ ri na ala a ama a̱ A̱sula̱ uɗanu.</char></note> a ta papa yi. <verse eid="DAN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 12:2" />Ama na̱ a̱bunda̱ a na a̱ kuwa̱i a̱ ri a a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ma̱buta̱ me iɗa a̱ ta̱ 'yon, ozo o ro a̱ tyo a wuma u babu ukotu, ozo o ro waru a uwwa a̱tsuma̱ o wono ni ili i na a tarai ili shi babu ukotu. <verse eid="DAN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 12:3" />Aza a na a̱ ri nu ugbozu a̱ te ikana cine vu revei ekan a zuva, waru a̱ ka̱mba̱toi ama na̱ a̱bunda̱ a̱ tyo a̱ a̱ɓula̱, o to o'wo ne ekan tsi italyo'o babu ukotu suru suru. <verse eid="DAN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 12:4" />Amma a̱vu gba Daniya, vu kutsulu a̱vu vu zuwa ukere e idanshi ya aatagada'a hali a̱ tyo ɗe elime. Ama na̱ a̱bunda̱ a̱ ta̱ 'ya̱wa̱ na̱ a̱ ta̱wi adama a̱ da̱shi tsura̱ urevu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 12:5" />A̱vu a̱mu Daniya, n ka̱lyuwa̱ a̱vu me ene ama e re mishin elime a̱ va̱, za ta̱ a̱ nge'en mu uɗolu u nda za ta̱ gba shi a̱ nge'en ndeɗe. <verse eid="DAN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 12:6" />A̱vu za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ e le u damma za na ri wotowu no okoro, za na da̱na̱i gon mini, &lt;&lt;Hali a̱ tyo mantsa ma̱ ne ma ɗa ili ya asalama a nda aa shiwan?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 12:7" />A̱vu za na ri wotowu no okoro, za na da̱na̱i gon mini mo uɗolu, u 'ya̱sa̱n ukere u sa'ani wa̱ yi oɓolo nu ukere ugula̱ wa̱ yi zuva, a̱vu mu uwwa yi u kucina na̱ za na ri lo babu ukotu, adansa, &lt;&lt;A ta tara mantsa ma̱ ta̱ na̱ mantsa nu uɓatsulai u mantsa. Nu ucira wa ama a akiza u rukutsa̱, ili i nda suru i ta shiwan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 12:8" />Mu uwwa ta̱ ili i na u dammai, agba n gura tsura̱ urevu shi. Ɗaɗa n tse ece, &lt;&lt;Zagbain va̱, nye i ɗa ili i nda ya̱a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 12:9" />A̱vu u usu, &lt;&lt;Yuwan mmalu ma̱ wu, Daniya, adama a na a̱ kpa̱to ta̱ adanshi a nda nu uzuwu wu ukere hali she mantsa me elime. <verse eid="DAN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 12:10" />A̱ ta̱ ka̱mba̱to ozo o ro cece, o o'wo babu abasa waru a ta lapula le, amma a̱za̱ e iwuya a ta lyuwa elime ni iwuya i le. A̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱za̱ e iwuya babu za na a̱ tsura̱ urevu, ele gba a̱za̱ o ugbozu u ta̱ tsura̱ urevu.<verse eid="DAN 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 12:11" />&lt;&lt;Diga a mantsa ma na a putsa na̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu vu urana suru, a̱vu waru a̱ shuwa̱ ili yi idaba i na i tsu ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ mona, a ta yuwan rana ukpakukupa nu ukpaku ure na̱ kupakucci (1,290). <verse eid="DAN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 12:12" />Za va aba'un ɗa vuma na kaɓai asuvu hali u rawai ukosu wu urana ukpakukupa nu ukpakuta'atsu na̱ mata'atsu no ozo o ton (1,335).<verse eid="DAN 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 12:13" />&lt;&lt;Amma a̱vu gba, yuwan mmalu ma̱ wu hali a̱ tyo elime. Vu te ivuwan, a̱vu a rana vu ukosu, vu 'yon vu ushi akunda a agadu a na a zuwaa nuwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="DAN 12:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 12" />
</usx>